	('315024161', '315024', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Talitha shows some improvement in this term. She needs to be more focus while studying in class and home. She should be active to ask to the teacher if does not  understand about the lesson. Show your best and keep studying Talitha!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315024162', '315024', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Thalita shows improvement in this term. She has a good concentration in class. She starts to brave asking the teacher about the lessons she does not understand. keep studying Thalita and show your best!', '2016-12-16', '16'),
	('315024164', '315024', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Congratulations on your achievements in this semester. Be a better person and improve your dicipline in Junior High School level. Hopefully you can make more achievements in various aspect. Good job, Thalita! ', '2017-06-16', NULL),
	('315025153', '315025', '2015/2016', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Valsya is a polite and well-mannered learner. She makes effort to learn. She completes work well. She needs to pay attention in detail in daily work (more review and reading would be helpful) . Keep up the good work, Valsya!', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315025154', '315025', '2015/2016', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Valsya is pleasant and cooperative student. Her attitude toward school is excellent. She shows responsibility well and has fine attitude. She is capable of better work, yet she still needs guidance.', '2016-06-24', NULL),
	('315025161', '315025', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Valsya is a nice student. She follows the lessons well in class. She also has a good relationship and communication with her friends. She should be more careful in doing some exercises. Keep studying and increase your grades Valsya!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315025162', '315025', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Valsya can follow the lessons well in class. She is a good student. She can accepts the lessons well. She needs to be more focus in learning social-studies lessons. Be more careful doing the exercise. Increase your grades Valsya!', '2016-12-13', '10'),
	('315025164', '315025', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Congratulations on your achievements in this semester. Make more achievements in Junior High School level and improve your knowledge. Good job, Valsya! ', '2017-06-16', NULL),
	('315028161', '315028', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Adelia has shown her study progress. She has developed her responsibility and independence. She is able to grasp the material given from the teachers well. Also she is able to read extensively for enjoyment. Keep up the good work, Adelia!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315028162', '315028', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Adelia is responsible student. She shows her enjoyment for joining all class activities and good attutude in her relationships among other students and teachers. She developes concentration skills and demonstrates consistent effort and motivation in her learning process. Well done, Adelia!', '2016-12-16', '8'),
	('315028163', '315028', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Adelia has increased her maturity while doing all learning activities. She shows her responsibility and independence in all of her tasks. Good job, Adelia!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315028164', '315028', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Adelia has shown a good sense in writing skills. She is able to communicate with others well and interact with classmates in a positive way. She has developed her confidence with a good expression while joining competition. She also shows her enjoyment during the class activities in this semester. Keep up the good work, Adelia!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315028171', '315028', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Adelia is a nice student. She pays attention in class and always listens to the teachers. She needs to be more focus and concentrate when studying in class and home. Improve your grades and study hard Adelia!', '2017-10-13', ''),
	('315028172', '315028', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Adel has done a nice job this semester and completing assignments with quality in mind. She can follow the lesson well and having a good self-confident. Congratulation and keep it up Adel! ', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315028174', '315028', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Alhamdulillah Adel has completed all tasks in  Primary level with a good score. Be a student who always makes achievements in the next education level. Congratulations Adel on your accomplishment!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('315029161', '315029', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Adhira is an enthusiactic learner and manages his feelings and  emotions well in the classroom. However, he is not yet active participant in small or large group discussions. I am so proud of all you have accomplished. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315029162', '315029', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Adhira has a good quality of leadership, he listens as well as shares during our discussions and he is always willing to help a classmate. However, he needs encouragement about his creativity. You are amazing student!', '2016-12-16', '4'),
	('315029163', '315029', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Adhira has done good efforts during this mid term. he is capable to work independently and consistently in every tasks. he shows his maturity while doing the learning process. good job, Adhira!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315029164', '315029', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Adhira is a good listener and an enthusiastic student. He has done good efforts. He needs encouragement for his creativity and he needs to be more confident to express his opinion. You are a great student, Adhira!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315029171', '315029', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Adhira has a pleasant personality. He is doing strong work in all areas. Adhira also uses common sense to solve the problem independently and in a positive manner.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315029172', '315029', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has been a nice working with Adhira. He is a generous student, not only to his classmates but also to his teacher. He has never disturbed his friends in the class. In academic, Adhira has an interest in mathematics. He could finish his mathematics score confidently. For other lessons, Adhira has shown his good manner in the learning process in the classroom. It gives a positive impression for each teacher. Keep your good character, Adhira.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315029174', '315029', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'A year with Adhira was a wonderful year. Adhira never showed any sense of competition to his classmates. He only focus on his improvement in learning achievement. In his friendship, Adhira showed that he began to open and dare to express his opinion. Adhira is no longer a silent introverted boy, but now he has become a warm friendly boy.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315030161', '315030', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Adira has good interest in English, Science, Math and Social Studies. She is able to follow the classroom rules well. She shows enthusiasm for classroom activities. However she needs to be more socialize to other students in the class. Stay to be good, Adira!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315030162', '315030', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Adira is a good manner student. She is able to fulfill all the tasks given by the teachers. She responds excitedly when she gets quiz questions from the teachers. She has developed her confidence during this semester also she takes a good responsibility for her learning. Well done, Rara!', '2016-12-16', '1'),
	('315030163', '315030', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Adira enjoys joining class activities every day. She sometimes looks unexciting to follow some of activities. She needs to improve her motivation to study successfully. Keep on moving, Rara!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315030164', '315030', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Rara is a thoughtful student. She is able to listen to the ideas, opinions and attention without interrupting. She has very good quality in mind. She shows a great interest in English, Math and Social Studies. She also shows perseverance on challenging assignments. Well done, Rara!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315030171', '315030', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rara is a smart student. She can follow the lesson very well. She is also a good listener and always pays attention in class during teaching and learning activity. Good job Rara!', '2017-10-13', ''),
	('315030172', '315030', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rara displays an excellent attitude. She enjoys doing neat, careful work. She has the ability to follow directions. She is continuing to grow in independence. I am so proud of all you have accomplished. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing, Rara!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315030174', '315030', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Alhamdulillah Rara has completed all tasks in  Primary level with a good score. Be a student who always makes achievements in the next education level. Congratulations Rara on your accomplishment!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('315031161', '315031', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alenois is an enthusiastic learner who seems to enjoy the school. He is able to take his responsibility for learning. He really enjoys doing the computer lesson. He is able to follow classroom rules and conduct himself with maturity. He needs to remind not to talk too much while he is eating his food. Keep on to improve, Ale!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315031162', '315031', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alenois is thoughtful in interactions with others. He shows good interest on doing discussion and answering quiz. He also requires support to interact with classmates in a positive way. He is developing consistent work habits.Keep on moving, Ale!', '2016-12-16', '11'),
	('315031163', '315031', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alenois has increased his study interest during this mid term. He looks enjoying to participate the whole of class activities. He sometimes looks playful while studying the lesson. We would like to see more of his study consistency on the next term. Keep on trying to be better, Ale!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315031164', '315031', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Alenois is an ethusiastic learner. He shows critical thinking in each lesson. He likes to ask some questions creatively. He still needs to be reminded to manage the time well during the class activities. He has really good interest in computer and science.Keep on doing well, Alenois!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315031171', '315031', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alenois is a self-motivated worker. Sometimes, he can listen to his friends and teachers, but sometimes he interupts in an explanation by asking sometihing just to get attention or to show his experience or knowledge. He is also a good leader and has many friends. Alenois needs to pay closer attention to all of subjects.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315031172', '315031', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Vinzky is an innovative student. Everything could be utilized to be toys. He plays with his friends happily every day. Unfortunately, he has not understood where and when he should play. He often plays in the learning process. Sometimes it is very disturbing. For the next term, please pay more attention to your teacher in the learning process, Vinzky.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315031174', '315031', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'The last two years with Alenois were fun time. He is an energetic child and has a strong character. Physical activities are his interests. However, it makes him less concentrated in classroom learning. A number of teachers have reported that Alenois was not focused while studying. Hopefully along with his development and maturity, Alenois can behave according to time and place.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315032161', '315032', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Vinzky demonstrates a good respect to others and enjoys spending time with friends. He still needs to be flexible in dealing with friends. He shows a better performance this term. I am confident the next one will be even better.', '2016-01-08', NULL),
	('315032162', '315032', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Viznky is making good use of our resource library and he is respectful to others. He needs to be more enthusiastic in learning activities at class. He is one sensitive person in and out of the classroom. Never give up for studying!', '2016-12-16', '16'),
	('315032163', '315032', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Vinzky is a taciturn student at class.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315032164', '315032', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Vinzky is a good student. He uses resource of library well and he is a goog listener when the teachers give advice for him. He still needs to be flexible in dealing with friends and to be more enthusiastic in learning activities at class. Study harder, Vinzky!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315032171', '315032', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Vinzky did not show an optimum effort in learning. He likes to play in the classroom. Everyday, he creates a toy by using recycle things. It is so creative and a wonderful intelligence, but, now, he is a sixth-grader. Hee needs to focus on learning as the preparation of the national examination.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315032172', '315032', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has been so nice working having the opportunity to work with Alenois. He is an active student in classroom. He has high determination and critical thinking. He always asks everything to teachers in the learning process. It shows his curiosity, especially in science field. It is better after Ale has gotten his interest, it could be accommodated by well. One important note for Alenois is his effort to do the best. Ale has a wonderful ability, but it has not been optimized yet. Please prepare well for the national examination, Ale! ', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315032174', '315032', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'The last year with Vinzky was a considerable time. Vinzky has potential in the academic field. However, Vinzky did not show any serious efforts to improve it. Several times when he feels disappointed for one thing, vinzky lets it down by writing or speaking inappropriate. Basically, he is a very good and obedient child. Real attention is needed by him. Moreover, Vinzky entered the age of teenagers that requires parental assistance.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315033161', '315033', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Alya shows a good responsibility as a student to fulfill her all tasks. She has a well development to understand all lessons given. Also she is able to respond the question from the teachers well. Good job, Alya!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315033162', '315033', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Alya is a good listener. She shows her good ability especially in Math, English and Science. She is able to conduct herself with maturity. Very good, Alya!', '2016-12-16', '4'),
	('315033163', '315033', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alya has shown her spirit decline on her study during this mid term. She needs to increase her motivation to participate the learning process. We would like to see her study consistency on next term. Keep on trying to improve, Alya!', '2017-03-31', NULL),
	('315033164', '315033', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Alya is an obedient and responsible student. She has shown her perseverance in all assignment given. She also has shown good efforts in her study during this smester. But she still looks shy to speak in front of the class. Be more active, Alya!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315033171', '315033', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alya is a cool girl. She has a modest demeanor. She is able to separate learning and social times by well. She just asks questions or seeks clarification when needed in the learning process. I would like to see Alyas work on Math, Science, and all of the national examination subjects. I believe in you, Alya!!!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315033172', '315033', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has been so nice working having the opportunity to work with Alya during her sixth grade year.  Alya is different. She has a unique character. Let everything flow like water. It is an appropriate utterance for Alya. She does not have a competitive spirit. Although she has grown tremendously in all areas of the curriculum and has shown herself to be well balanced in both academic and social areas. Please prepare everything by well for the next semester, Alya. ', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315033174', '315033', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'The last two years with Alya were great times. Along with age, Alya becomes a person who has a strong and independent character. She is able to understand and care for the feelings of others. Not only her classmates who liked Alya, but also her friends from other classes. In the learning process, Alya is an independent student and attention to the lesson.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315034161', '315034', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Amanda is respectful of others and listen to the ideas, opinions, and comments of others without interrupting. But, she is very shy and a quite person in and out classroom. Keep doing your best, Amanda!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315034162', '315034', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Amanda is an eager reader during silent reading time and she is a good listener during our discussions and presentations. However, she is very shy and a quite person in and out classroom. Well done, Amanda!', '2016-12-16', '11'),
	('315034163', '315034', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Amanda is an attentive student in the class, she shown a good attitude, and she still quite in and out classroom.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315034164', '315034', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Amanda is a good listener to ideas and  opinions of others without interrupting. Amanda shown a good attitude in and out classroom. She is still shy when she meets and interacts with others. Keep shinning, Amanda!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315034171', '315034', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Amanda is an uncommunicative student. This year is the last chance for her to make a friendship. Without any communication, her friends do not know so well about her. Amanda, we are family in the class. So, you do not need to hesistant to share everything to your friends.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315034172', '315034', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'The most important thing for Amanda is her verbal communication. She often does something by herself in the classroom. Her best friends are her sister. For the next term, it is better for Amanda to try for playing with her other classmate. Build your courage up, Amanda and prepare well for the national examination.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315034174', '315034', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Confidence is still a problem that must be solved immediately. Amanda can grow and develop in the future quickly if the problem is solved. During the sixth grade, Amanda became an individualist, but did not feel depressed. She enjoyed every second of togetherness with her jubilant classmates. Stay passionate and dear to your twin sister, Amanda.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315035161', '315035', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anggita is respectful of others and manages her feeling and emotions well in the classroom. She is still shy when she meets new person. You are an amazing student and you truly shine! ', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315035162', '315035', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Anggita likes to accompany our songs with rhythm instruments, she masters math concepts easily and listens carefully. She participates well in organized projects and group discussion. I am so proud of you, Anggita!', '2016-12-16', '3'),
	('315035163', '315035', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anggita is polite to all person in and out of the classroom and she has poise on the stage. she needs to be more confident to expres her idea or opinions. keep moving, Anggi!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315035164', '315035', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anggita demonstrates a good behavior in and out classroom and she can be relied on. She needs to be more confident to explain her organized projects and her opinions in front of class. Good work, Anggita!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315035171', '315035', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anggita has made great progress across the curriculum since the beginning of the school year. She is an enthusiastic learner especially at mathematics. She is also kind and caring. Her friendly character makes her as a role model for her classmates.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315035172', '315035', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anggita has made good progress across the curriculum since the beginning of the school year. She continues to show growth in her math skills and is willing to ask questions when she is unsure of what to do. Anggita is really working on being a good friend and classmate, respecting others space and time much more. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing, Anggita. I am so proud of you for all the great work you have done so far this year!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315035174', '315035', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Anggita is one of the best students in his generation. In academia, Anggita who has an interest in mathematics also shows serious attention to other areas during the learning process. She always shows a persistent effort in understanding a learning material. Friendship is also very good. She has a number of close friends who can support each other.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315036161', '315036', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Bryan is learning to be cooperative when working in groups. He needs to be encouraged to comply with school rules,such as no playing inside the classroom and paying attention during the lesson in class. I would like to see his improvement in academic skills such as English and Science. Keep on to improve, Bryan!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315036162', '315036', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Bryan enjoys joining class activities everyday. He needs encouragement to finish his tasks in discipline and needs more pay attention during the class activities. Keep on trying to be better, Bryan!', '2016-12-16', '13'),
	('315036163', '315036', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Bryan has shown his good participation in the class activities. He still needs to be supported to finish his homework on time. We would like to see more his study consistency on the next term. Keep on moving,Bryan!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315036164', '315036', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Bryan is an active and cheerful boy. He likes to express his feeling when he joins the class discussion group. He needs to be consistent to finish the homework on time. Keep moving, Bryan!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315037161', '315037', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Carin always puts evident effort into her work as she completes assignments with quality in mind and manages her feelings and emotions well in the classroom. However, she is a quite person in the classroom. Being more active in having conversation with friends will give her a better progress for her social skill. keep shining, Carin!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315037162', '315037', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Carin has a good self concept, she is role model for our class with her good behavior. Her dancing is graceful and flowing. She needs to be more confident to express her opinion and feeling. Keep shining, Carin!', '2016-12-16', '1'),
	('315037163', '315037', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Carin is always ready to learn and she pays good attention to detail in daily work. she does not actively participate in class. you are an amazing student, Carin!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315037164', '315037', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Carin manages her feelings and emotions well in and out classroom and she pays good attention to detail in daily work. She must be more actively participate in classroom and needs to be more confidence to express her opinions. Keep your work up, Carin!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315037171', '315037', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Carin is a wonderful student who appears to be a deep thinker. She has done very nice job this term, taking pride in her work and completing assignments with quality in mind. She is a role model for our class with her good behavior. ', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315037172', '315037', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Carin has had a very good term. She is working hard and making progress in all areas. Carin consistently makes good choices in all she does. Her contributions to class discussions are numerous and very relevant; through them, she demonstrates she is listening and using critical thinking skills. She has done a very good job memorizing her math facts and I know she will master them by the end of the year. Carin has shown nice improvement in turning homework assignments in on time consistently. Continue to do all the wonderful things you are doing, Carin! I can hardly wait to see all the wonderful things you accomplish in this final semester!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315037174', '315037', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Carin is a calm student figure in every activity. Her calm reflects her intelligence and maturity. This is what makes her friends much liked. She never boasted or pretended like a boss even though she was clever. Maintain your positive character.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315038161', '315038', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Deninda is able to take her responsibility during the class activities. She is a good listener but she needs to demonstrate her improving social interaction skills such as speaking up with others and expressing her own feeling during the class activities. Keep trying to speak up , Deninda!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315038162', '315038', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Deninda is learning to be cooperartive when working in groups. She has shown steady progress in English, Science and Social Studies. She needs more encouragement to improve her social intearction to others. Keep on moving, Deninda!', '2016-12-16', '14'),
	('315038163', '315038', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Deninda has shown her responsibility to do all the tasks. She is developing a bit confidence to do a speech in front of the class. She needs more encouragement to speak up confidently. Keep trying to be better, Deninda!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315038164', '315038', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Deninda is a very calm student. She is able to understand the teachers explanation. She has good study progress during this semester. She needs more to be encouraged to do communication among other students. Just be confident, Deninda!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315038171', '315038', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Deninda can accept the lessons well. She pays attention and listens to the teacher well. She can follow the lessons and has a good concentration in class. Keep it up and do your best, Deninda!', '2017-10-13', ''),
	('315038172', '315038', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Deninda is pleasant and friendly. She shows responsibility well and has fine attitude. She needs gaining more self-confidence. She has made nice progress this reporting period.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315038174', '315038', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Alhamdulillah Deninda has completed all tasks in  Primary level with a good score. Be a student who always makes achievements in the next education level. Congratulations Deninda on your accomplishment!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('315039161', '315039', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Derryl is able to listen attentively and follows directions well. He has shown to be cooperative when working in groups. He has great interest in Math, English and Science. Good job, Derryl!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315039162', '315039', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Derryl is an obedient student. He is able to express his ideas clearly and cooperate consistently with the teacher and other students. He is responsible to finish all his assignments in discipline. Keep on trying to be better, Derryl!', '2016-12-16', '7'),
	('315039163', '315039', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Derryl has shown his study consistency during this mid term. He shows a good responsibility on his tasks. He gets good interest in Math, English, Science and Social Studies. He still needs to improve his speaking English ability. Keep on moving, Derryl!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
