	('315054171', '315054', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Thank you, Mom, for your continued support and help from home. The amount of extra time you have been spending with Cece on her school work is evident. She understands the relationship between addition and subtraction, and multiplication and division as the basic concept of mathematics. Please, try to study harder and keep your spirit. You will got it!!! ', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315054172', '315054', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'All teachers love to Chelsea. She has good manner to her teachers. She could melt among some different communities without change her own characteristics. She is also a brave student and has good enough confidence. Her academic field shows her interest in physical activity, art, and social matters. Although she has found her interest, she needs to improve her ability in mathematics. Chelsea may to discuss with her friends how to solve a mathematics problem. Good luck for your next term, Chelsea, and study harder!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315054174', '315054', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Chelsea is one of the students who showed the most significant academic achievement. She strives to achieve her goals consistently and sustainably. Hopefully her national exam score is in line with the hard work she has done so far.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315055161', '315055', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ghaffar has shown steady progress in Math, English and Science. He is able to take his responsibilty during class activities but sometimes he needs to remind for paying attention to the teachers and working the tasks accurately. Keep running your best effort, Ghaffar!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315055162', '315055', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ghaffar is well liked by peers. He shows great interest in Math, English, Science and Computer. He enthusiastically participates in joining class discussion, quiz and question-respond session. He is able to conduct himself with maturity. Keep up the good work, Ghafar', '2016-12-16', '6'),
	('315055163', '315055', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ghaffar has demonstrated good interest in all subjects. He shows good study consistency during this mid term. He sometimes needs to be reminded to finish his homework on time. Keep on tryng to be better, Ghaffar!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315055164', '315055', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ghaffar is an active and talented student. He has shown his good study motivation consistenly. He demonstrates improvement in academic skill. He is able to require support to interact with classmates in a positive way. He needs to write his handwriting nicely. Keep up the good work, Ghaffar!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315055171', '315055', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ghaaffar has made very good academic progress this term. When he is able to settle down, he does much better work. However, he is often seeking the attention of his classmates during in the class activity which causes distraction for everyone. Ghaaffar needs to manage his feeling and emotion by well and play in a safe manner to his friends.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315055172', '315055', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Classroom would not be the same without Ghaaffar. He brings a smile through our door along with great enthusiasm each day. Ghaaffar is a strong critical thinker, always wonders why and how things happened. He also has a good habit by eating fruit every snack time.  The habit is very important for his digestive system. Prepare your best for the next term, Ghaaffar. Good effort in the next term will influence your preparation for the National Examination.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315055174', '315055', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Ghaaffar is a cheerful kid. He is very liked all his classmates. In expressing his opinion, he is very mature and diplomatic. His ability in pouring positive ideas also gets a thumbs up from some teachers. He is a melting atmosphere when the class is serious. His academic achievement is also quite good. The last two years with Ghaaffar were an unforgettable moments.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315056161', '315056', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ravelino is developing his good manners and positive ways to interact with others. He is becoming a good listener and showing his self confidence in front of the class. He needs to be encouraged to work the tasks accurately and demonstrate improvement in academic skills such as Math and English. Keep on trying your best effort, Ravel!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315056162', '315056', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ravelino is developing concentration skills and consistent work habits such as completing the tasks, homeworks, and projects. He looks enjoy the learning process in the classroom. He needs more improvement in English and Science. We would like to see his improvement for the next semester. Keep on trying to be better, Ravel!', '2016-12-16', '15'),
	('315056163', '315056', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ravelino has shown his study enthusiasm during this mid term. He shows well participation in all class activities. He needs to improve his skill in English and Science. Keep on trying for your best effort, Ravel!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315056164', '315056', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ravellino is an enthusiastic student. He is able to be a good participant in the class discussion. He enjoys joining the class activities. He needs more encouragement to study English and Science. Keep on moving, Ravel!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315057161', '315057', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rizky shows enthusiastic for classroom activities. But, he is easy to be influenced by his friends and he must be active to learn in the classroom. I am so proud of all you have accomplished.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315057162', '315057', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Rizky work well in a group, he is respectful of others, he asks and answers question that demonstrate understanding. He needs to encourage his confidance to speak in front of the class. Keep your work up!', '2016-12-16', '9'),
	('315057163', '315057', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Rizky asks questions when he needs clarification. He is polite in and out of the classroom. He needs be more active to learn in the class activity. Keep moving to be better!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315057164', '315057', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Risky shows politeness to adults and he cares to his best friend. He needs to pay more attention on learning process and  daily work. Keep on trying to be better, Rizky!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315057171', '315057', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rizky is a smart student. He can follow the lessons very well. He has a good understanding to the lessons. Congratulations Rizky, and keep it up!', '2017-10-13', ''),
	('315057172', '315057', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rizky shows good results in this semester. He is able to follow the whole lesson. He socializes well and honestly against any behavior he does. Congratulations Rizky!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315057174', '315057', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Alhamdulillah Rizky has completed all tasks in  Primary level with a good score. Be a student who always makes achievements in the next education level. Congratulations Rizky on your accomplishment!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('315058161', '315058', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Sabrina has a good personality. She is polite to everyone whom she meets at school. However, she must be more active to learn in the classroom. You are an amazing student and you truly shine!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315058162', '315058', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Sabrina has poise and grace on the stage, she pays attention to detail in daily work, but she is too easily distracted. Keep your work up, Sabrina!', '2016-12-16', '13'),
	('315058163', '315058', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Sabrina is a good listener, she is caring, and she is an independent person, but. she needs encouragement to be mature in joining all activities.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315058164', '315058', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Sabrina is polite to everyone she meets at school and she is caring. She needs to pay attention in daily work and to be more cooperative in joining all activities.  Keep doing your best, Sabrina!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315058171', '315058', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Sabrina is a nice student. She always pays attention in class during teaching and learning activity. She also has a good relationship to all her friends. Keep studying Sabrina and do your best!', '2017-10-13', ''),
	('315058172', '315058', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Sabrina is a nice girl. However she needs to try to be more serious and focus in learning. Improve your concentration in class and do your best!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315058174', '315058', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Alhamdulillah Sabrina has completed all tasks in  Primary level with a good score. Be a student who always makes achievements in the next education level. Congratulations Sabrina on your accomplishment!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('315059161', '315059', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Ghania takes great pride in all of the work she does. She is courteous and shows good manners in the classroom. She is able to conduct herself with maturity. I am proud of all her academic skills that she has made. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing, Ghania!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315059162', '315059', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Ghania is an active learner. She is able to take an active role in discussions. She has a well developed vocabularies. She shows good understanding for most of lessons given and her assignments with quality in mind. Congratulation, Ghania!', '2016-12-16', '2'),
	('315059163', '315059', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ghania has done good efforts during this mid term. She is capable to work independently an consistently in every tasks. She shows her maturity while doing the learning process. Good Job, Ghania!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315059164', '315059', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Ghania is a thoughtful and well mannered student. She always looks excited to join every class activity. She is one of the role model in the class. She is able to listen attentively to the responses of others. Keep up the wonderful things you have done!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315059171', '315059', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has truly been a pleasure getting to know your child this term. Ghania is a clear thinker and has good organization of thoughts. Ghanias reading has improved considerably day by day throughout fourth grade till now. One area for improvement is mathematics. She needs to prepare well for the national exam. ', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315059172', '315059', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ghania continues to be an awesome sixth grader! She is focused on her learning, highly motivated, and conscientious in her work. She has made great strides with her analysis and synthesis of text during reading and has improved her comprehension of informational material as a result. Although Ghania is doing well on her geometry, she should continue to review other fields of math like numeral operations. Ghania continues to complete her assignments in very neat and organized manner and I am always proud of her work. Way to go Ghania! I can hardly wait to see the great work you do in your final semester!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315059174', '315059', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Ghania has been a part of my life for the last three years. She is a student who is very critical of the condition around and have a firmness in learning. Know your self and love your family, then you will find the path you seek. Make prayer a part of your struggle.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315060161', '315060', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Yoan is learning to be cooperative when working in groups and gaining is self confidence. Sometimes he looks moody during the class activities. He needs encouragement to be more mature doing all class activities and working on his tasks more accurately. Keep on trying to do your best, Yoan!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315060162', '315060', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Yoan is developing concentration skills and consistent work habit. He is having some difficulties with Math. He needs more practice to do Math exercises and encouragement to do his tasks with good management of time. Reach your success, Yoan!', '2016-12-16', '10'),
	('315060163', '315060', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Yoan has developed his study consistency during this mid term. He shows good responsibility on his tasks and well understanding during the lessons given. Keep trying to do your best effort, Yoan!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315060164', '315060', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Yoan is an obedient and cheerful student. He has demonstrated his independence and responsibility on his study. He is able to put evident effort into his work with quality in mind. He has done his role in joining class activities well. Good job, Yoan!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315060171', '315060', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Yoans attitude towards our school rules, the other students and myself is reflected in this reporting term. He is capable of being successful student with effort. Sometimes he gets upset easily because of a simple thing although Yoans growth in social maturity is continuing. I believe in you, Yoan!!! ', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315060172', '315060', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has been so nice working having the opportunity to work with Yoan during his sixth grade year. He has gotten mature and has shown his best effort in leading the class, even sometimes he joins with his friends and makes a noise in the classroom. One area that important to be improved is his responsibility in doing everything. It is better if he does everything seriously with his utmost ability. Enjoy the process and you will achieve everything you want.  Because a result will never betray his process.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315060174', '315060', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Three years with Yoan is a wonderful year. He shows more maturity in thinking, speaking, and acting. Family support is the key to Yoan\'s success. Gain your ideals and love your family.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315061161', '315061', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Zafarrel is respectful of others and listen to the ideas, opinions, and comments of others without interrupting. But, he needs to be more active in the class activities. I am so proud of all you have accomplished.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315061162', '315061', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Zhafarrel is polite to adults and peers in and out of the classroom, he is an active listener person, but he is shy and a quite person in the classroom. You are so great!', '2016-12-16', '6'),
	('315061163', '315061', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Zhafarrel shown respect for authority and he is a good listener, but. He needs to be more active in class activities.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315061164', '315061', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafarrel demonstrates a good respect to others and he is an independent person. He needs to be more confident to expres his idea or opinions. Keep moving, Farrel!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315061171', '315061', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Farrel is showing positive development in regards to his attitude in our classroom. He takes an active part in discussions pertinent to mathematics area and IT. He has an interest in computer operation. Good boy, Farrel!!!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315061172', '315061', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Farrel enjoys this term. He has tried to do his best effort in all subjects, but based on the learning process and the result, he indicates his interest to mathematics. In addition, he has an interest to read kind of books, like novels and comics. Different with his progress in the academic, his social activities at school, especially in the classroom have not shown a significant improvement yet. But do not give up. Just try your best for making a friendship without taking off your own characteristics. ', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315061174', '315061', '2017/2018', '4', '', '', 'Zhafarrel is one of the most notoriously quiet students. However, along with the dynamics that occurred in the classroom, Zhafarrel slowly became an open student figure and willing to associate with his other classmates. His academic ability is unquestionable. He is very attentive to the lessons and manners to anyone.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315062161', '315062', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Arkaan is a good student. He has good self understanding when facing the lesson. He also starts to be strict to the school rules through remind his friends who is breaking the rules. ItÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s an excellent improvement of ArkaanÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s academic and attitude. However, Arkaan needs to learn to have good empathy to others. Good luck for the next term, Arkaan.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315062162', '315062', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arkaan is an active, smart, diligent, and helpful student. He has good understanding in the learning process. He likes to help his friend who doesnÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢t understand the material. Otherwise, Arkaan needs to control his big spirit during answer the question from the teacher. So, other students can get the same chance like Arkaan. Keep shining, Arkaan!', '2016-12-16', '3'),
	('315062164', '315062', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arkaan academic ability is awesome. He is capable to do very well in almost all subjects. The things that need to be improved by Arkaan is trying to be patient, be a good listener to others. Be better in the next level! ', '2017-06-15', '2'),
	('315063161', '315063', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Ariel is extremely pleasant to have around and very friendly to everyone in the class. He is respectful to other students and teachers, and takes turn talking. He is eager to learn and is quick to improve himself.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315063162', '315063', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Ariel has shown great potential with his effort and an extremely motivated student at the class. He has dicipline manner and no doubt to ask the teachers when he has misconception on studying. However, he needs to improve his confidence when he performs in front of people.', '2016-12-16', '1'),
	('315063163', '315063', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ariel is a real asset to my class. He has a great attitude towards school and schoolwork. He is a good listener and takes direction very well. He is a very pleasant student and is working well with others. Keep it up, Ariel!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315063164', '315063', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'It has been a pleasure having the opportunity to work with Ariel during his 4th grade year. He is an enthusiastic learner and truly good student. He shows perseverance in all he does. He is polite to adult and peers in and out of the class. He completes work with quality in mind. I am proud of all you have accomplished. Keep the wonderful things you are doing!]', '2017-06-15', '1'),
	('315063171', '315063', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ariel is a nice and polite student. He is an enthusiastic learner. Overall he is achieving well in all academic skill areas, he needs to work more accurately and carefully in doing his work. Keep doing your best, Ariel!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315063172', '315063', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ariel is an outstanding and smart student. He has qualities of leadership and good confidence. He is capable of doing  classrroom work even he is sometimes in hurry. He needs to be more careful on doing exercise and test. Overall, he does well in all subject. Keep it up, Ariel!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315063173', '315063', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ariel is able to maintain his academic performance and his achievement is above average. He listens attentively during classroom activities and willing to follow the teachers\' intructions. Keep up the wonderfull things you are doing, Ril!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315063174', '315063', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has been a pleasure to have Ariel in our class this year. Ariel has done well in many areas. He consistently shows his best effort. He seems to enjoy school and his positive attitude brighters up our classroom. Stay humble and excellent, Ariel! ', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315063181', '315063', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Ariel has been in the spotlight since he was in 4th grade. His calm character is the key to his success in the academic field. Ariel, who begins to grow up, must continue to protect himself from the influence of social environment and social media. If Ariel is consistent in his behaviour and in the academic field, Insya Allah, he will achieve success. Continue to be introspective and careful!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315063184', '315063', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'In the last term at Ananda Islamic School, Ariel is always consistent showing a friendly and polite attitude to all teachers and friends. Not only his attitude is commendable, Ariel also excels on the academic side of most of his friends. Maintain your attitude and increase your academic achievements at the next level, Ariel!', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315064161', '315064', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Bayu is a nice student. He has no doubt once he has a problem about the lesson. However, in order to help your child with his work ethic, I suggest spending time with him each night going over his lesson and (or) homework.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315064162', '315064', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Bayu is a unique student and is responsible through his studying. It is a joy to have Bayu in my class, he has a great sense of humor and is sometimes filling his spare time with fellows. However, Bayu still needs to improve his ability through his studies due to better result for the next semester.', '2016-12-16', '5'),
	('315064163', '315064', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Bayu is able to respond well with direction and takes constructive critism well. He has no doubt asking to the teachers when he has a problem on studying. He has to be more focus and does not be a rush on doing schoolwork. I hope he can do his best till the end of semester.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315064164', '315064', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'It has truly been a pleasure getting know Bayu in my class. He always shows his smile at class. He sometimes makes funny moments that makes his friends know his personality. However, Bayu needs to pay closer attention to the way his study. He needs study more than now. I believe he can get more than now. Indeed, Bayu is a joy to have in my class.', '2017-06-15', '9'),
	('315065161', '315065', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Kayla is a cheerful student. She is always excited to come to school for learning in the class and also to meet her friends. She has good self understanding when learning in the class. She knows when she understands or does not understand the lesson. ItÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s an excellent skill of learning. However, Kayla needs to learn how to be focus when her feeling is not in good condition. Keep shining, Kayla.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315065162', '315065', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kayla is an active, smart, and helpful student. She has good understanding in the learning process. She often initiates to help her friend who doesnÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢t understand the material. Besides, Kayla needs to learn the good way when she reminds her friend who still canÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢t speak English fluently. She also should learn to be more responsible of her school stuff. Keep shining, Kayla!   ', '2016-12-16', '2'),
	('315065164', '315065', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kayla has an amazing academic ability. In addition, Kayla has a good relationship with her friends. For further progress, Kayla needs to learn to be focus during learning process in the classroom and be a good listener to others. Be brighter in the next level!', '2017-06-15', '3'),
	('315065171', '315065', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kayla always comes with a smile to the class and ready to learn. She speaks english in the class consistently and confidently. She shows good improvement in her work. She is able to follow the lesson well. She just needs to work more carefully to avoid careless mistake. Good luck, Kayla!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315065172', '315065', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kayla is a cheerful student and working well with others. She is constantly increasing her skills in some subjects. She has tried her best in the class and shown good progress. Keep it up, Kayla!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315065173', '315065', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kayla is a cheerful student. She speaks English in the class consistantly and confidently. She can tell stories and enjoys spending time with her friends. She needs to improve her work habit in doing Math and Matematika exercises to avoid careless mistake.You can do better, Kayla!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315065174', '315065', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kayla has made a great job overall this year. She works independently and is able to complete enrichment activities when she has finished with required assignment. Stay focused and fabulous, Kayla!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315065181', '315065', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'It\'s great to be able to have a joke with Kayla. She is an expressive student in delivering her ideas. She also does not hesitate in criticizing something. In academic terms, Kayla has shown quite good achievement. However, she must be grateful and not judge herself if she gets a value that is not in line with her expectations. In behaving with the teacher, Kayla still has to show polite attitude without distinguishing between one teacher and another.', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315065184', '315065', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'The existence of Kayla in the classroom is like light that illuminates around. When she was afflicted with sadness, it was very visible on her face. The condition she was experiencing was a challenge for her. Luckily, Kayla has parents who support her all the time. This condition can foster her mental spirit. God is always with you, Kayla!', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315066161', '315066', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Faizan is the classroom leader and is always willing to help out other classmates when needed. He has a good attitude toward the school, respect, and listen carefully to the teachers and friends. He does well in every single subject.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315066162', '315066', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Faizan is responsible student, is focus during the class, has dicipline manner, and respects both to teachers and friends. He is also has a creative way of using color and design on his art class. I have enjoyed having Faizan in my class. Keep it up for the next semester, Faizan!', '2016-12-16', '4'),
	('315066163', '315066', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Faizan has made improvement in his leadership skills. He has a good confidence in front of the class and is good helper within the classroom. He is eager to learn and is quick to improve in areas that are lacking. Keep it up, Faizan!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315066164', '315066', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Faizan makes an effort to make his handwriting legible. He is one of the calmest student in the class. He has good personality and open minded. He is polite to adults and peers in and out of the class. He is truly an asset and has qualities of leadership. I am so proud of all you have accomplished. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing!', '2017-06-15', '4'),
	('315066171', '315066', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Faizan has done a good work this term. He shows his enthusiasm in learning and his best effort on his daily work. On the other hand, he needs to be more focus on the teachers instruction. Keep spirit and be better for next term, Faizan!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315066172', '315066', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Faizan has done a good work this term. He shows his enthusiasm in learning and his best effort on his daily works. On the other hand, he needs to be more focus on the teacher`s instruction. Keep spirit and be better for next term, Faizan!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315066173', '315066', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Faizan arrives at school each day with a smile and ready to learn. He is able to separate work and social times. He could solve his school work\'s problem after seeking the clarification detail from the teachers. He tries to understand well. Keep learning and improving, Faizan!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315066174', '315066', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Faizan is helpful, kind and is a plesure to be around. He shows his talent in sport. He has a strong work ethic and never completes any assignment halfway. Stay positive and bright, Faizan!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315066181', '315066', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'It is a pride to know Faizan. In his daily life at school, Faizan can mingle with anyone. He shows his politeness to all teachers. In the academic field, Faizan still has to improve his achievements. He has great potential to grow. Reach your best achievements in the next term, Faizan!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315066184', '315066', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Faizan is a strong-minded student who has a strong character. This character is one of the positive aspects that can be seen in the past a few months. If he has a different view from his friends, he is brave enough to convey it in the right way. In addition, his academic values ??continue to increase progressively.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315067161', '315067', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', '', 'Griselda is a nice student. She is good to all friends and polite to the teachers. In academic, even Griselda has good ability to understand the material, she is still shy to explore her potential in the learning process. Therefore, Griselda needs to improve her self confidence to have a better progress in the next term. ', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315067162', '315067', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Griselda is a nice student. She respects the teachers and her friends. She often asks to the teacher when she doesnÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢t understand about the material. However, Griselda should improve her ability in reading. She also needs to be more confident. Be better for the next semester, Griselda!', '2016-12-16', '14'),
	('315067164', '315067', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Griselda is a nice student to her teachers and friends. Her learning outcome progress is very good. For brighter results in the level, Griselda needs to be active and do not be shy to ask the teacher when she is facing difficulties of learning activity. Good luck, Griselda!', '2017-06-15', '10'),
	('315068161', '315068', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Citra is a kind student. She has good progress in the learning process. It seems through the increasing result of practice test and mid-test. Citra only needs to be more confidence to maximize her potential in academic and non-academic. Keep shining for the next term, Citra.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315068162', '315068', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Citra is a nice and diligent student. She respects to the teachers and her friends. She always collects school tasks on time that help her to increase academic result. However, Citra needs to improve her reading skill. She also must learn to be confidence. Be better in the next term, Citra!', '2016-12-16', '8'),
	('315068164', '315068', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Citra has a good learning outcome progress. She always pays attention to the teacherÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s explanation. She has learned to be active in the learning process. Be better in the next level!', '2017-06-15', '8'),
	('315068171', '315068', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Citra is a nice student. She shows her progress in this term. She joins classroom activities actively. She needs to be encouraged to use her time wisely. She enjoys spending time with friends. Keep doing your best, Citra!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315068172', '315068', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Citra is polite, kind, and always willing to help her classmate. She still needs to be more active in class. She is able to follow the lesson well. She just needs to work more carefully to avoid careless mistake. Good luck, Citra!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315068173', '315068', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Citra has been encouraged to take an active part in shared learning activities. She works well to improve her academic skill. With her continued effort, she will receive much satisfying from her work. Good luck, Citra! ', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315068174', '315068', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'I have truly enjoyed gething to know Citra in our class this year! She is an attentive student and is workig well in all subject areas. Keep impressing with your pleasant attitude and outstanding work, Citra!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315068181', '315068', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Coming to school early each day compared to other friends gives her the opportunity to prepare for learning. That is the image of Citra that we can capture during the first three months of this school year. Citra has a good spirit of learning and a friendly attitude towards all of her friends. This makes her liked by everyone. Get your best achievements in your final year, Citra!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315068184', '315068', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Citra increasingly shows consistency in learning. This can be seen from the academic values ??which continuously increase progressively. Her excellent academic ability was balanced with her pleasant attitude and was liked by friends and teachers. Maintain your positive character, Citra!', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315069161', '315069', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandari', 'B', 'Echa does good in every single subject in the school. She is also a nice student and respectful to others. she has good attitude toward school and schoolworks, and is always willing to help out otherclassmates when needed.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315069162', '315069', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Echa is a smart student. She has no doubt to ask the teachers when she has misconception on studies and cares to her fellows. However, she is sometimes still careless on doing work. She still needs to improve her concentration skills due to her better work. Be better fo the next semester, Echa!', '2016-12-16', '2'),
	('315069163', '315069', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Echa is a joy to have in the class. She is a pleasant student and actively volunteers to help around the room. She is excited to learn new ideas and grasp the information quickly. While she has good improvement and attitude towards school,she needs to maintain her ability till the end of semester. Always do your best, Echa!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315069164', '315069', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Echa has made very good academic progress and could compete well with others. She is an enthusiastic learner and an active participant in group discussions. She shows perseverance in all she does. Congratulation on your achievements in this grade. You are amazing student and keep up the wonderful things you are doing!', '2017-06-15', '2'),
	('315069171', '315069', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Maitsaa misses some activities of class agenda this term. She is a nice girl. She needs to be encouraged to work more slowly and accurately. Overall, she is a good student. Keep up the great work, Maitsaa!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315069172', '315069', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Echa is polite, kind and well mannered. She is an active participant in class discussions and knows the answer when called upon. She completes daily assignments in a timely manner. Keep it up, Echa!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315069173', '315069', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Maitsaa is progressing well in all areas. She could improve by slowing down and taking more care on her work. Keep doing your best, Echa!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315069174', '315069', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Maitsaa is very compassionate and nice to everyone. She seems to enjoy learning. She completes her works with quality in mind but she needs to pay detail on her test. Stay persistent to get your goal, Echa!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315069181', '315069', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Getting to know her since she was in grade 3, Echa showed a positive attitude that is consistent up to now. Courteous and religious manners are a very obvious image of herself. Even in the academic field she shows effort and hard work so that she gets satisfactory results. Keep your enthusiasm in learning and maintain your positive attitude, Echa!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315069184', '315069', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'The last few months had been very hard for Maitsaa. The try out series and also the exam made her tired. Maitsaa needs to rest well to overcome USBN in April. The physical fatigue she experienced greatly affected the acquisition of her academic values. We hope that everything will improve so that she has sufficient preparation to face the test.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315070161', '315070', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'A nice writing is a potential that belong to Naufal. He is able to memorize what teacher explain trough his writing in the notebook with his own way. ItÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s an excellent skill of learning. HeÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s academic is good enough. Naufal only needs to be more confident and trusts himself that he can do the best. Keep shining to the next term Naufal.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315070162', '315070', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Naufal is a nice, diligent, responsible, and discipline student. He is able to finish the school task well. He respects to the teacher and his friends. He also has good writing and concentration during learning process. Otherwise, Naufal needs to improve his confidence when present his project in front of the class. Keep shining, Naufal!', '2016-12-16', '4'),
	('315070164', '315070', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naufal is a good, polite, and respectful student to teachers and friends. Additionally, Naufal has a good improvement in socialize to his friends. He has big respect of learning process looks from his responsibility to submit the school tasks on time. For further progress, Naufal needs to increase self-confidence of his ability. Be brighter for the next level, Naufal!', '2017-06-15', '5'),
	('315070171', '315070', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naufal is polite to his teachers and peers. He respects his teachers and follows teachers instructions. He is capable of doing his class work. He needs to be more focus and carefully in doing his work. You can do better, Naufal!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315070172', '315070', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naufal has good ability to understand the lesson but he needs to concentrate more during the lesson. It would be better for him to pay more attention to details on his daily work. You can do better, Naufal!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315070173', '315070', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naufal shows satisfactory progress in all his works. He is willing to perform his best effort in doing the assignment. He gradually shows improvement and has accomplished a lot during this term. Keep your great spirit, Naufal!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315070174', '315070', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naufal is able to work independently. He demonstates good work on the test. He works well with his group. Paying more attention during the lesson will be benefical for him. You can do better, Naufal!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315070181', '315070', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Nabil\'s twin brothers have similar personalities. Naufal is a student who is calm and mature in responding to something. All of his friends liked Naufal because his attitude is easy going. Naufal also has great potential in the academic field. His attention in the learning process in the classroom shows that he is an active learner. However, he must be more careful in understanding a problem. Good luck Naufal in the next term!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315070184', '315070', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Unlike his younger brother, Naufal is still not motivated to reach amazing values. The opportunity is still wide open and we sincerely hope that Naufal can show a very significant change at the last opportunity!', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315071161', '315071', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Gilang works very hard for his grades and is constantly asking questions on how to improve his work. He needs to improve more his studies and concentration skill in the class. I hope he would be better for the next term.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315071162', '315071', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Gilang has a creative mind that lends itself to great art expression. However, he needs to learn how to work well with others and how to stay focus during the class. He is sometimes being a score-oriented student, not a process-oriented student, and that is no true. He should change the way he thinks if he wants to be better for the next semester. Good luck, Gilang!', '2016-12-16', '8'),
	('315071163', '315071', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Gilangs handwriting needs to be improved to meet standard upper level. He also needs to increase his ability to listen and follow direction carefully. While Gilang has been performing well in some subjects, he needs to improve his concentration skills. All he must do is concentrate harder during the lesson.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315071164', '315071', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It is a pleasure having the opportunity to know Gilang in my class. He has shown all he could do, however that was not the best one. Gilang needs more exercises to maintain and even gain his abilities. Even though his handwriting is not so good, but his creation on drawing is fantastic. Keep the wonderful things you are doing and keep it up for the next grade!', '2017-06-15', '7'),
	('315071171', '315071', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Gilang is a moody boy. He shows interes in Science and IPA. However, he needs to be more carefully in doing his daily work and assignments. Keep doing your best, Gilang!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315071172', '315071', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Gilang is progressing well in all areas. He could improve by slowing down and taking more care on his work. Keep doing your best, Gilang!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315071173', '315071', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Gilang has been progressing in his socialization and academic skill. He needs to take a more active part in class discussion. Keep improving your self, Gilang!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315071174', '315071', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Gilang has good sense of art and he shows good progress in some lessons. He demonstrates hard work on the assignment. He needs to manage his feelings well. Having more practice and attention on the lesson will be useful for him. Always do your best, Gilang!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315071181', '315071', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Gilang is stepping towards the teenage phase. His attitude needs an intensive attention. With the right guidance, and not judging him, Gilang will slowly realize and be able to take into account the impact caused to himself and also to others. In academic terms, Gilang needs to increase his confidence. The effort he has shown is good enough. Keep your spirit, Gilang!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315071184', '315071', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'In the past few months, Gilang had shown a very good attitude change. In the previous semester, he lacked of confidence and had low responsibility for his duties, and another cases in this semester. His good attitude influenced his academic achievement. If Gilang is able to be kind and show a more persistent effort to learn consistently, Insya Allah, Gilang will be a great child.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315072161', '315072', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandairn', 'C', 'Ricky is a nice student. He likes to share his food to his friends and teacher. He often shares what his feeling to the teacher. His empathy to others is very good. However, Ricky should learn how to be focus during learning activity in the class. Ricky also needs to improve his discipline for the better in the next term. Good luck, Ricky.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315072162', '315072', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Ricky is a good, caring, and helpful student. He always has initiate to help the teacher. He is a good friend for others. Besides, Ricky has to learn speaking fluently. He needs to improve his reading skill. He also needs to be more discipline and be responsible of his school task. Good luck for the next semester, Ricky!', '2016-12-16', '12'),
	('315072164', '315072', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ricky always has a good initiative to help others. Ricky is also pleased to share with friends, especially for sharing his food. Sharing to others makes him happy. ItÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s a nice behavior to be maintained. Being active and focus will help him to be better for the next level. Good luck!', '2017-06-15', '11'),
	('315072171', '315072', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ricky is an obedient student. He always listens to the teachers instruction. Sometimes, he still likes to day dream in the class. He needs to improve his skill in Maths, Matematika, Science, and most of the lessons. A constant guidance to review his lesson at home will give him many benefits. We would like to see his study consistency on the last semester to pass this level. Good luck, Ricky!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315072172', '315072', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ricky is friendly. He is helpful. He needs to be encouraged to concentrate and stay focused on the task. He also needs to be more responsible with his school stuffs. Never give up, Ricky!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315072173', '315072', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ricky is a cooperative student. He doesn\'t feel hesitate to helpthe teachers and friends when needed. The teachers still need to encourage him to use time constructively in class.  As he often use his time to day dream. Contributing more effort when doing his work will delveri him to be more persistent worker. You can do better, Ricky!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315072174', '315072', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ricky is nice and innocent. He is truly eager to perform his project well. He enjoys reading books and making an art. However, he alsways has to be reminded to focus and finish his work in the classroom. Stay focus and always do your best, Ricky!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315072181', '315072', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Ricky is a communicative student. Every day he always asks interesting things. Chat with him is very fun. In academic terms, he has shown sufficient results. In the future, Ricky must continue to develop his inner potential in the field he likes. If in the previous years, Ricky often banged his body against the wall, then this year has been reduced. But he often practiced martial arts techniques that he struggled with kicking the door. Directives and guidance continue to be carried out and Insya Allah, will show optimal results.', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315072184', '315072', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'A brilliant and attentive student towards the surrounding conditions, that is the right description for Ricky. Ricky is very consistent in learning. He always entered the top 10 in the results of the try out. However, he must work even harder if he wants to achieve his goal, entering the Government Secondary School.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315073161', '315073', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Although Salsa is having trouble in several subject, she is trying her hardest to improve. She has to gain her concentration skill during the lesson. I suggest her to continue the study after school hours in order to get better for the next term.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315073162', '315073', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Shalsa is a quite student and has a less communication to the teachers. She should be more active and open when she has misconception while studying so the teachers and (even) friends can help. Otherwise her lack of personality, she is a good, polite, and smart student.', '2016-12-16', '12'),
	('315073163', '315073', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Salsa is a taciturn student at class, however she is pleasant and working well with others. I really hope she can be more active at the class. She needs to improve her confidence to speak in front of class and group discussion. I really hope she can show her active learing at the class.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315073164', '315073', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Salsa has done a nice job in this grade. She is takingpride in her work and completing assignments well. One area for improvement is her confidence at class to be  an active student. However, I am proud of all she has accomplished. Keep up the best things you are doing, Salsa!', '2017-06-15', '11'),
	('315073171', '315073', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Shalsa is a calm student. Actually she can do her work accurately, when she puts her mird on it. By studying and practicing at home we are sure that she can achieve a good result. Keep doing your best, Shalsa!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315073172', '315073', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Salsa is a calm student. Actually she can do her work accurately when she puts her mind on it. By studying and practicing at home we are sure that she can achieve a good result.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315073173', '315073', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Shalsa is calm student. Actually she can do her work accurately, when she puts her mind on it. By studying and practicing at home we are sure that she can achieve a good result. Keep doing your best, Shalsa!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315073174', '315073', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Shalsa is a calm and friendly. She shows great progress on her social skill. She gets along well with other in the classroom. However, she still needs to be more responsible to accomplish the tasks and project. Paying more attention will be good for her. Do your best and never give up, Shalsa!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315073181', '315073', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Broadly speaking, Shalsa requires attention and guidance. As time went by, Shalsa grew older. She will be able to understand the situation, but intensive guidance is needed for her. If this is fulfilled, Insya Allah, not only her academic value that will improve, but also her sense of confidence will also increase. Excitement, Shalsa!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315073184', '315073', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Patience and independence can be seen clearly in the face of the Shalsa. Her friends love her character. However, Shalsa still needs to struggle to improve her positive achievements in the academic field.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315074161', '315074', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Ziyi is an excellent student. He has a lot of good talent. ItÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s seems through his ability to communicate in mandarin language, memorize juz 30 of Al-QurÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢an, memorize multiplication and division of math lesson, etc. His academic and non-academic is balance. However, Ziyi needs to learn how to manage his emotion. He also must learn how to enjoy the process of learning activity in the class. Good luck for the next term, Ziyi. ', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315074162', '315074', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Ziyi is an active, smart, and fast learner. He has good understanding in the learning processs. He always asks to the teacher to make him more understand about the lesson. Otherwise, Ziyi needs to control his emotion and be focus when the teacher explaining the material. Keep shining, Ziyi!', '2016-12-16', '1'),
	('315074164', '315074', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Ziyi is an excellent student. His academic and non-academic result shows that he has good ability. For the better progress, Ziyi needs to control his emotion well. Therefore, Ziyi could be a student that is bright in his academic, spiritual, and emotional. Keep shining!', '2017-06-15', '1'),
	('315074171', '315074', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ziyi is a smart boy. He is able to follow the lesson well. He needs to improve to manage his emotion and feeling to his teachers and peers. He is easy to express his anger to his peers. Keep improving your self, Ziyi!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315074172', '315074', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ziyi is an independent learner and smart student. He has good ability to understand the lessons. He needs to concentrate more during the lesson. It would be better for him to pay more attention to the details on his daily work. He also still needs to manage his feelings and emotions well in the classroom. you can do better, Ziyi!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315074173', '315074', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ziyi is an independent learner. He has shown his new spirit in learning. He starts to show his ability to manage his emotion now. Keep doing your best, Ziyi!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315074174', '315074', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ziyi is an active participant in class discussion. He puts evident effort into his work as he completes assignments with quality of mind. He needs to react properly of something that he has seen or heard. Stay fabulous, Ziyi!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315074181', '315074', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Ziyi is one of the students who has a very strong character. Ziyi has great fighting power and enthusiasm in achieving every target he has planned. Not only in academics, Ziyi also excels in sports, especially his favorite sports, futsal. However, Ziyi still needs to improve his attitude towards his friends around him. Sometimes, friends around him feel uncomfortable and are forced to do something. Insya Allah, as Ziyi grows older, he will become an increasingly wise and compassionate person.', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315074184', '315074', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'A courageous and ambitious figure in reaching for life goals is clearly illustrated by Ziyi. He really needs consistency in learning because the great potential in him has not been maximized in the past few months. Ziyi must focus more on the final phase he will face. Good preparation is very important for him.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315075161', '315075', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Ryan is able to make friends quickly both boys and girls. He also does well in every subject. Otherwise, he needs to improve his concentration skill in order to get better for his grade.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315075162', '315075', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Ryan makes friends easily and is getting along with nearly every classmates. He is smart student, however he still needs more focus within the classroom and should decrease his playful behaviour. I believe he would be excel once he gains a better understanding of oncentration. Good luck, Ryan!', '2016-12-16', '6'),
	('315075163', '315075', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Ryan understands the importance of sharing the joy through stories and games. However, he needs to improve his overall work habits and concentration skills at class. He needs to apply himself more to the lesson in order to get better ability for his class.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315075164', '315075', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has been a pleasure having the opportunity to work with Ryan during his 4th grade year. He enjoys spending time with friends. He needs to apply himself more to all areas of study in order to get better than before. I know he can do more than he gets now, but he should maintain and even gain his ability by syudy harder. congratulation on your achievement on this grade. Keep up the best things you are doing!', '2017-06-15', '6'),
	('315076161', '315076', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anye makes friends easily although she is a quite person. I believe she is capable of producing a better work, all she must do is concentrate harder during the class. I hope that she would be better for the next term.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315076162', '315076', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Anye is caring to fellows at the class, however she still needs to improve her work habit and concentration skills. She has lack of awareness on study. She is still passive and rarely ask questions to the teachers when she has misconception. She should change the way she studies if she wants to be better for next semester. Good luck, Anye!', '2016-12-16', '10'),
	('315076163', '315076', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anye has shown a little change on her studies at the class. She is dare to ask the teacher when she has problems on the lesson. Afterwards, she is capable of producing better work; all she must do is concentrate harder on the lesson and her work.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315076164', '315076', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anye does well in class, however she needs to learn on some subjects. She is a good helper to female students whitin the social area. She is respectful to other students and takes turn talking. However, she needs to pay closer attention to her absentee and daily works. I hope she can be better in the next grade. ', '2017-06-15', '13'),
	('315077161', '315077', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Daffa is a nice student. However, he needs to improve his overall work habits and concentration skills. I feel that he would be excel once he gains a better understanding of concentration.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315077162', '315077', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Daffa still needs to improve his overall work habit, concentration skills, and dicipline manner through his studies. Although he is having trouble in several subjects, he is trying his hardest to improve. He is also good at Mathematics. Be better for the next semester, Daffa!', '2016-12-16', '11'),
	('315077163', '315077', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Daffa is one of energetic student on the lesson he likes, the other way less to the lesson he is lack. He is good at Math and Matematika, but less on English. If Daffa is going to improve his English, he needs to improve his daily speaking towards teachers and friends. so far, he has shown some progress on his studies.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315077164', '315077', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Daffa makes friends easily and enjoys spending time with friends. Although he has troubles in several subjects,  I know he has tried his best. One area for improvement is his dicipline manner. I am confident the next grade will be even better if he can improve his dicipline manner. Keep it up for the next grade, Daffa!', '2017-06-15', '10'),
	('315078161', '315078', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Fazel has good discipline.  He always tries to complete all school stuffs very well. He also has good spirit when learning in the class. However, Fazel needs to improve his self understanding during learning activity. It aims to maximize his potential to be more shining than now.  Good luck for the next term, Fazel.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315078162', '315078', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Fazel is a good student. His spirit to come to school is always shining. His knowledge is good and he is a kind person for his friends. Otherwise, Fazel needs to read the book to reach the information that help him to more understand about the lesson. Therefore, FazelÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s academic result will be more excellent for the next term. Keep spirit, Fazel!', '2016-12-16', '6'),
	('315078164', '315078', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fazel is a good and polite student to the teacher. He is also friendly to his friends. For further progress, Fazel must learn to be more active in the learning process in the classroom. Good luck, in the next level!', '2017-06-15', '6'),
	('315078171', '315078', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fazel is a capable student. He needs to work carefully to avoid careless mistake. He could have performed better if he pays more attention and does his work accuratelly. Do your best, Fazel!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315078172', '315078', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fazel is a nice student. He makes friends easily and enjoys spending time with friends. How ever, he is sometimes less confidence when called upon. Keep up your good work, Fazel!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315078173', '315078', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fazel shows improvement in several subject, though he needs to be encouraged to exhibit the use of English in class activities. He could help performed better if he pays attention and does his work seriously. Keep improving, Fazel !', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315078174', '315078', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fazel is able to work independently. He works very well with his group. However, he needs to pay attention during the lesson and complete assignment with quality of mind. Keep doing your best, Fazel!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315078181', '315078', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Fazel is one of the students who has strong character. This distinguishes him from most students. He still enjoys his childhood. However, in the academic field, Fazel can show seriousness in the learning process. One thing that needs attention is he must be brave and courageous to express his opinion without being influenced by his other friends.', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315078184', '315078', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Fazel had a difficult time in his friendship and had been involved in a problem with his classmates. However, after the incident, Fazel went to become a stable student day by day. Emotional stability and calmness of his heart supports his performance in academic values. He really needs consistency in learning in the next step.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315080161', '315080', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Affan is an independent and strong student. He never asks help to others as he can do it by himself. He pushes himself to follow all activities in school. ItÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s an excellent spirit to be the role model for other students. However, Affan should learn to manage his condition because his academic result is decreasing. Keep shining to the next term, Affan.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315080162', '315080', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Affan is a nice student. He respects teachers. He is a kind person for his friends. However, AffanÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s academics result for this semester is decreasing. Therefore, Affan needs to study hard for the better result in the next term. Keep moving forward, Affan!', '2016-12-16', '10'),
	('315080164', '315080', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'AffanÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s spirit to come to school is a good thing and need to be appreciated by parents and teachers. AffanÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s independence as a student is also very good. The thing that need to be improved by Affan is trying to be active in the learning process. Show a good progress in the next level!', '2017-06-15', '12'),
	('315080171', '315080', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Affan is an enjoyable student. Added effort and attention his part could rise his english and math grade, and strengthen his other academic subjects. Keep trying to be better, Affan!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315080172', '315080', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Affan is an enjoyable student. Added effort and attention his part could rise his Matematika and Math grades and strengthen his other academic subjects.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315080173', '315080', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Affan is an enjoyable student. He needs to improve his responsibility to finish his works given by the teachers. As he often does his works with less effort. The teachers still try to encourage his to be more focus on his lesson to achieve to better improvement. Good luck, Affan!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315080174', '315080', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Affan shows his enthusiasm for outdoor activities. He still needs lots of practice in English, Science, and Math. He requires constant encouragement to build his confidence and motivation within himself to learn and grow. Trust yourself that you are better than you think. You can do better, Affan!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315080181', '315080', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'At first, Affan\'s health condition was our concern. What\'s more, Affan was hospitalized. However, his hard work in learning and supported by his friends who loved Affan very much, he is able to keep up with the rhythm of learning, even though the results are still lacking. There are still many things that need to be improved academically, Affan. So be prepared as best as possible!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315080184', '315080', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Every student has different abilities in the academic field. Especially for Affan, tahfidz is a subject that he likes and his ability to memorize the holy verses of the Quran is quite good. Continue to develop your interests, Affan!', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315081161', '315081', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'A nice attitude is belonging to Keona. She always tries to be a kind student everyday. Her discipline is very good. Her good attitude and academic is growing very well. Keona only needs to improve her good self understanding during learning activity. DonÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢t be easy to give up when you are facing challenging lesson. Keep going on, Keona.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315081162', '315081', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Keona is a nice and diligent student. She always finishes the school task on time. She is a kind person to her friends and teachers. She has a good self-understanding of the material that teacher given. Besides, Keona needs to manage her nervous when learning in the class. Be better for the next term, Keona!', '2016-12-16', '9'),
	('315081164', '315081', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Keona is a good, polite, and respectful student to her teachers and friends. Her learning outcomes in this semester is also good. For better progress in the next level, Keona needs to be more confident and persistence in encountering difficult lesson. Good luck, Keona!', '2017-06-15', '4'),
	('315081171', '315081', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Keona is a good and nice student in the class. She loves to learn a new thing and shows her spirit by engaging herself in the classroom activities actively. Keep up the wonderful thing you are doing, Keona!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315081172', '315081', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Keona is a nice student. She makes friends easily and enjoys spending time with friends. How ever, she is sometimes less confidence when called upon. Keep up your good work, Keona!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315081173', '315081', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Keona is a capable student. She needs to work carefully to avoid careless mistake. She need to encourage to be mature. She is still easy to cry in the class. Keep improving your self, Keona!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315081174', '315081', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Keona is able to work induvidually and stay on task. She is a nice, calm, and polite student. She is commited to doing her best. She needs to manage her feeling well. Keep growing and showing your perseverance, Keona! ', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315081181', '315081', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'A personal who is serious in learning and persistent in work, she is Keona. She has very high determination in academic matters. On the one hand, this can have a positive impact, but if the mentality is not ready, it can destroy her self-confidence. Make peace with yourself, Keona and keep your spirits!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315081184', '315081', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Keona with her melancholy character really needs support from around. If she gets a value that is not in line with expectations, she cries out and disappointed in excess. Keona must make peace with herself before starting to fight again to improve her academic values.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315082161', '315082', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Syaffa is a nice student. He sometimes shares anything to his friends in the class. However, he needs to apply himself more to all areas of study in order to get better score for his grade. He needs also gain his concentration skill during the lesson.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315082162', '315082', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Syaffa is good at outdoor activities such as Outing. He is brave and has something that his friends do not have. However, he needs to stay focus during the class activities and should decrease his playful behaviour. Be better for next semester, Syaffa!', '2016-12-16', '13'),
	('315082163', '315082', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Syaffa has a sense of humor that is quite enjoyable in the classroom. However, he needs to increase his ability more throughout all subject to get better work for his grade. I suggest having Syaffa continue studying the base subjects like Math, English, and Science in order for him to retain what he has studied at class. I hope Syaffa can be better till the end of semester.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315082164', '315082', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Syaffa enjoys spending time with friends. He is opened to suggestion of his bad habit, but he still does the same. He should be motivated by people around to improve his study. Despite of his lack of syudy and behaviour, he shows good manner when entering Mushola. he dares to get the micfor reciting sholawat and even Adzan. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing!', '2017-06-15', '12'),
	('315082171', '315082', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Syaffa is a friendly student. He still needs some guidance in completing his assignments. He needs to limit his talking and socializing time during the lesson. Keep your spirit in learning, Syaffa!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315082172', '315082', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Syaffa is a nice student. He makes friends easily. He needs to improve his overall studies however he has studied hard at home and school. He also needs to improve his fluency on reading and writing. I hope he can be better for next term. Never give up, Syaffa!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315082173', '315082', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Syaffa is an active boy. He needs to strength his skill in Math, English and most of the lessons. A constant guidance to review his lesson at home will give him many benefit. We would like to see his study consistency on the last term to pass this level. Good luck, Syaffa!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315082174', '315082', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Syaffa is a nice and cheerful student. He enjoys for outdoor activities. He struggles to understard the lessons and still needs to work hard to raise his grade. Trust yourself that you can achieve more, Syaffa!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315082181', '315082', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Syaffa is one of the students who really concerns us. At first glance, he still looks childish but sometimes he starts to show traits toward the juvenile phase. Syaffa really needs great attention both in the academic field. Mathematics is a frightening specter for him. By learning hard at home and at school, Insya Allah, can improve his academic values ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¹ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¹which are still low.', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315082184', '315082', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'The condition of Syaffa in the academic field did not show significant improvement. The physiological and mental phases that he is experiencing because of adolescence are very influential. He cannot be forced to study harder. If this is forced, then he will feel much burdened so that what is achieved is even worse. His parents must pray for Syaffa and accompany him by paying more attention!', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315083161', '315083', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Nashua is a nice student. Her attitude to friends and teacher is good. However, Nashua needs to improve some things for the better progress in the next term. The first, Nashua should study hard to achieve academic school standard. The second, she has to learn to have good self understanding in the learning process. The last, donÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢t be shy to ask to the teacher and friends about the lesson when she finds difficulties when she is doing her work. Keep going on, Nashua.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315083162', '315083', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Nashua is a nice student. She respects the teachers and her friends. However, Nashua needs to improve some things for the better academic result for the next semester. She has to learn to be more focus during learning activity in the class. She needs to improve her reading skill and her academic knowledge. Good luck, Nashua!', '2016-12-16', '13'),
	('315083164', '315083', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Nashua has a good learning outcome progress. She already gives the good effort for her academic improvement. She is also always pays attention to the teacherÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s explanation. For further progress, donÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢t be shy to learn. Show a brighter progress in the next level!', '2017-06-15', '14'),
	('315083171', '315083', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Nashua is an easy going girls. She needs to improve her responsibility to finish her work given by the teachers, As she often does her work with less effort. The teachers still try to encourage her to be more focus on her lesson to achieve a better improvement. Good luck, Nashua! ', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315083172', '315083', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Nashua shows good improvement on her work. Added effort and attention on her part could raise her Matematika grades and strengthen her other academic subjects.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315083173', '315083', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Nashua shows good improvement in her work. Added effort and attention on her part could rise her Math and Matematika grades and strengthen her other academic subject. Keep improving, Nashua!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315083174', '315083', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'She is a nice and cheerful student. She enjoys dancing and very good at it. We appreciate her struggle to achieve a better result. However, she still needs to work hard to raise her grade. Study well and be more confident, Nashua!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315083181', '315083', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Nashua always comes earlier than most other students every day. This habit can form a disciplined person and it will be needed by her in the future. She has an interest in Korean boy bands. This shows that she already has a sense of attraction towards men. Therefore, parents and teachers need to guide and monitor her. In the academic field, Nashua still has to improve her values ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¹ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¹in almost all subjects. Excitement, Nashua!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315083184', '315083', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Because of the low scores, her confidence was finally affected. Lately, we have been trying to give motivation so her self-confidence can be improved. Basically, each student has equal opportunities, but their efforts will determine the difference in the end result.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315084161', '315084', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarian', 'B', 'Nabil is working well with others and is also good in all study areas. He has good attitude and manner, respect to the teachers and students, and pay attention during the lesson. I hope he would gain more for the next term.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315084162', '315084', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Nabil is working well with others and is also good in all study areas. He is responsible to his work, has a good understanding ,has dicipline manner, and respects both to teachers and friends. However, he needs to gain his self-confidence to perform in front of people. Be better for the next semester, Nabil!', '2016-12-16', '7'),
	('315084163', '315084', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Nabil has shown improvement in his study areas. He has good attitude towards school and schoolwork. He is respectful to others and takes turn talking. However, there is one missing from him, he is less active at the class. I hope he can be more active for the rest of the semester.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315084164', '315084', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Nabil continues to have a great year in this grade. His handwriting is very legible. He is one of the calmest student at class. He  consistenly uses personel best effort on a daily basis and completes the assignments in a timely manner. One area for improvement is his confidence to be active at class. Congratulation on your achievement in this grade and I am confident you will be even better for the next grade. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing!', '2017-06-15', '5'),
	('315084171', '315084', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Nabil is able to separate work and social times. He tries his best to complete his tasks. He shows a good attitude towards homeworks and tasks. Keep up the good work, Nabil!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315084172', '315084', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Nabil is a nice boy. He is able to follow the lesson well. He just needs to work more carefully to avoid carelles mistake. Goog luck, Nabil!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315084173', '315084', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Nabil has done a good work this term. He shows his enthusiasm in learning and his best effort on his daily work. On the other hand, he needs to be more focus and confident. Keep spirit and be better for next term, Nabil!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315084174', '315084', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It is a plesure to have Nabil in our class. He is able to focus and stays on task during independent working times. According to his result. He seems to have repetition and practice to understard the material better. Do your best and never give up, Nabil!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315084181', '315084', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Nabil is a mature student. He shows that in friendly relations and in learning. He is a persistent learner, but if the results obtained are not in line with his expectations, then he will not be too disappointed. He will immediately rise and improve. Continue to be a positive and pleasant person, Nabil.', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315084184', '315084', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'At the last try out, Nabil was able to achieve good grades so that he got fifth place. However, his consistency is still in doubt. Continue to maximize your potential, Nabil. Learn more consistently and continuously! Insya Allah, the process will not betray the results.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315085161', '315085', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fafa has worked very hard for her high mars on this term and is showing constant improvement. She is eager to learn and is quick to improve in all areas study. I hope she could maintain her ability till the end of semester.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315085162', '315085', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fafa has a good attitude towards learning and is always trying her best and hardest to improve her ability. She has worked hard for her high marks and is showing constant improvement. However, she needs to manage her feeling well and be more open-minded both to friends and teachers.', '2016-12-14', '3'),
	('315085163', '315085', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Fafa has shown constant improvement towards school and schoolwork. She is extremely enthusiastic when comes to participate in the class and it is always a pleasure to have her take part in class discussions. She has plenty of personality and it sometimes first to raise her hands to answer a question. Keep it up, Fafa!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315085164', '315085', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fafa has made great progress across the academic since the beginning of the school year. She is an enthusiastic learner and an active participant in group discussion. She puts eident effort into her work as she completes assignments with quality in mind. I am proud of all she has accomplished. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing!', '2017-06-15', '3'),
	('315085171', '315085', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fafa is an active student. She loves to learn a new thing and shows her spirit by engaging herself in the classroom activities actively. However she needs to improve to manage her feeling and emotion in the classroom. Keep doing your best, Fafa!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315085172', '315085', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fafa is a kind student. She has good English and knows basic Math facts. She is a great asset to our classroom and her friends admit it. Keep it up, Fafa!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315085173', '315085', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fafa is an enthusiastic learner. She always completes daily assignment in a timely manner. She pays attention to detail in daily work. She should be more carefully in her count. Sometimes she counts in a rush and misses the numbers in Matematika. We are so proud of all you have accomplished. Keep doing your best, Fafa! ', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315085174', '315085', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'it has been a pleasure to have Fafa in our class this year. She is a good friend for others. She tackles classroom assignments, tasks and goup work in an organized manner. She remains an active learner throughout the school day. Keep impressing us in the next grade, Fafa! ', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315085181', '315085', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Fafa is more mature and open-minded to around. If in the previous years, Fafa was a perfectionist child and sometimes often forced her will on those around her, in this 6th grade Fafa understands and slowly becomes a wise person. Her potential in the academic field is very good. She is also an active learner and has a high determination of herself. Reach your highest achievement with consistency in learning, Fafa!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315085184', '315085', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Fafa, who grew up, showed a positive change in her attitude. She is wiser in addressing the differences and shortcomings of others. If she is more focused on herself, Fafa is able to reach each of her targets very well. This is proven by the positive achievement she has achieved. However, Fafa needs to be more careful with her consistency and calm in learning.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315086161', '315086', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ragheed is a good and polite student. He is friendly to others. Safe manner is his attitude during learning and playing in the school. Ragheed only needs to improve his discipline and spirit to finish his school task well. Be better for the next term, Ragheed. ', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315086162', '315086', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Ragheed is a good and helpful student. His self-understanding during learning in the class is increasing than before. He asks to the teacher when he doesÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢t understanding the material. After that, his ability in explaining to his friends who doesnÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢t understand is excellent. Besides, Ragheed only needs to be more powerful in the learning process to get the excellent result. Keep shining, Ragheed!', '2016-12-16', '7'),
	('315086164', '315086', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ragheed is a student who respects to his teachers and friends. His discipline to obey the school rules is good. However, RagheedÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s spirit in learning process is not too big although actually he has good potential to achieve the high result. Therefore, Ragheed needs to improve his spirit to be better in the next level!', '2017-06-15', '7'),
	('315086171', '315086', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ragheed is a friendly student. He shows his progress in this term. He could have performed better if he pays attention and does his work accurately. Keep improving, Ragheed!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315086172', '315086', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ragheed is able to separate between work and social time. He tries his best to complete his task. He shows a good attitude towards homeworks and tasks. Keep up the good work, Ragheed!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315086173', '315086', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ragheed has done a good work this term. He shows enthusiasm in learning and his best effort on his daily work. On the others hand, he needs to be more focus on the teachers instruction. Keep up the spirit and be better for next term, Ragheed!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315086174', '315086', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'I have enjoyed having Ragheed in our class this year. He has worked hard for this year. He makes a great job overall this year. He is capable of achieving a higher grade but needs to be more focused and responsible with his homework. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing, Ragheed!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315086181', '315086', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'In grade 6, he was elected as class leader. As a leader, he is a democratic leader. This can be seen from the way he leads that is not arrogant. In his first month, Ragheed did show his strength by occasionally shouting or making a louder voice, but after being reminded, he began to change his lead pattern. In academic terms, he is still consistently studying seriously. However, he still needs to improve his academic achievement, because we believe that he has great potential to develop.', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315086184', '315086', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Ragheed is one of the students who have values ??that are beyond expectation. If you look at the daily value and attitude in learning, Ragheed should be able to achieve better grades. It seems like Ragheed needs to calm down before facing USBN in April. Focus on your goals, Ragheed!', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315087161', '315087', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandairn', 'C', 'Pasha is a nice student. He is good friend for others. He is polite to the teachers. However, Pasha must learn how to be discipline. It will help Pasha to improve his skill in academic and non-academic. So, pasha will get better result for the next term. Good luck, Pasha.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315087162', '315087', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Pasha is a good student. He respects the teachers. He is a kind person for his friends. However, Pasha must be more discipline and responsible of his school task. He needs to study hard and improve his ability in reading to get more information. So, his academic achievement will increase in the next term. Good luck, Pasha! ', '2016-12-16', '11'),
	('315087164', '315087', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Pasha is a good and polite student to his teachers and friends. His ability to socialize with others is also very good. His academic result is decreasing. If pasha studies hard and focus in the learning process, then he can achieve amazing academic result. Therefore, Pasha needs to improve discipline in learning and does not talk with friends when the teacher is explaining. Show a better progress in the next level!', '2017-06-15', '13'),
	('315087171', '315087', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Pasha is an enjoyable student. He needs to be encouraged to exhibit the use of English in class activites. He can communicate his understanding well. Keep doing your best, Pasha!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315087172', '315087', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Pasha is a polite student. He shows good improvement in Matematika. Added effort and attention on his part could raise his score in other subjects. Do your best for the next term, Pasha!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315087173', '315087', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Pasha shows good improvement on his work, especially in Matematika. He needs to be more resposible with his books and assignment. He often forgets to bring his books in many subjects. Keep improving your self, Pasha! ', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315087174', '315087', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Pasha shows his enthusiasm for school activities. He is enjoy spending time with his classmates. However, he still needS to be more responsible to accomplish the tasks, project and his books. Keep up your good work, Pasha!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315087181', '315087', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'This term is a special term for Pasha. Pasha has proven to everyone that he is one of the students to be proud of by memorizing the 30th Juz of the Holly Qur\'an. Real support from loved ones around Insya Allah will further improve his achievements. Academically, what Pasha needs is focus. Because basically, Pasha has great potential in the academic field. Hopefully in the next term, Pasha will be able to achieve better academic value! Aamiin.', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315087184', '315087', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'The last few months Pasha showed a pleasant change of attitude. His cheerful attitude was the reason he liked his friends. Responsibility and persistence in learning still need to be improved by him. The great potential that he has must be balanced with hard work in learning consistently.', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315089161', '315089', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fira has good attitude towards the school. She is pleasant and friendly. However, she needs to improve her studies and concentration skill in the class. I feel that she would be excel once she gain a better understanding of concentration.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315089162', '315089', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'I have enjoyed having Fira in my class. She does all just the way she is. She is working well with others and is also good in some study areas. Otherwise, she is less competitive with others. I think she needs it to burn her passion on study at the class so she can gain her ability better.', '2016-12-16', '9'),
	('315089163', '315089', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Fira is a very pleasant student and is working well with others. She is increasing her skills in some subject, however she needs to put more effort into her daily schoolwork. I hope she can be better until the end of semester.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315089164', '315089', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has truly been a pleasure getting to know Fira in this grade. She always arrives at school each day with a smile. One area for improvement is her focus on study. She needs to pay closer attention to the teacher while studying at class. I think she needs more motivation from the people around in order to make her study harder. Congratulation on your achievement on this grade. I am confident the next grade will be better if you do harder than this grade!', '2017-06-15', '8'),
	('315089171', '315089', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Safirra still needs to be more active in class. Added effort and attention her part could rise her skill in lesson. The teachers still encourage her to be more focus on her lesson to achieve a better result. Keep practising and trying, Fira!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315089172', '315089', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fira is calm student. Actually she can do her work accurately when she puts her mind on it. By studying and practicing at home we are sure that she can achieve a good result.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315089173', '315089', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fira is a moody girl. Sometimes she has a good passion to work hard in several subject. She needs to focus and concentrate more during a lesson. It would be better for her to pay more attention to the details on her daily work. She also needs to manage her feelings and emotions well in the classroom. You can do better, Fira!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315089174', '315089', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fira is cheerful and friendly. She is still struggling with some lessons. She needs to memorize basic Math multiplication and work hard to spell the word correctly. Do your best and never give up, Fira!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315089181', '315089', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'The first three months with Fira is a fun moment. Fira starts showing her maturity. She starts to control emotions. However, in the academic field she still needs improvement. Hard work and consistent effort in learning will greatly help her in improving her academic values. Prepare the next three months as best you can, Fira!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315089184', '315089', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'This is the last term for Fira at Ananda Islamic School. In her final step, Fira showed a significant improvement in the academic field. Meanwhile, her daily life in the classroom is still the same as before. However, her friends understand her character. Prepare yourself to reach your future, Fira!', '2019-05-29', NULL),
	('315090161', '315090', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alila can easily make friends to everyone at school. She makes an active involved in any activities. It would be much better if she can show her performace at lesson too. Keep practicing and do not give up trying.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315090162', '315090', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alila shows good improvement in her works. Added effort and attention on her part could raise her math grades and strengthen her other academic subjects. Keep your spirit, Alila!\r\n', '2016-12-16', NULL),
	('315090164', '315090', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alila is a nice student. She is able to follow the lesson well. She needs to improve her writing and English skill. More practice at home will bring her to get a better result. Keep up the good work, Alila!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315090171', '315090', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alyla is  polite, kind, and well mannered. At the beginning of semester, she was a shy student, but now she is trying to build her self confidence. She sometimes comes to the teacher to make sure whether she is right or not on doing the exercise. I hope she can be better for the next term and believe in herself.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315090172', '315090', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alila is a nice student. She works well in a group otherwise she needs more effort and confidence on doing exercises individually. She is capable of producing better work. All she must do are pay attention to the lesson and do not be hesitate to ask the teachers if she has any difficulties. I wish she can improve her ability for next semester.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315090173', '315090', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alyla is a pleasant student and is working well with others. She does well in class, however she needs learn more than she does. She has to be brave and sure to study in the class even to solve the questions. I hope she could be better for the last term.', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315090174', '315090', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alila is showing good improvement since I met her in the first month of the school. Now, she has courageus to ask or even come forward to answer questions on board. However, she needs more effort to finish the exercise individually. I hope she could have more practice to be better for the next grade level. Alila, always believe in yourself that you can do it!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315090181', '315090', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Alila enjoys spending time with friends and gets along well with others. However she should do more effort on her daily lesson, specifically for Science, IPA, and Matematika. She sometimes needs encouragement to work independently. I hope she can be better for next term.', '2018-10-12', NULL),
	('315090183', '315090', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Alila is a good student. She has a good social skills and enjoys spending time with friends. However, she should control her emotion to be not sensitive. On the other hand, she needs to keep studying to increase her ability in class. Keep it up, Alila!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315090184', '315090', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Alyla is a nice student and loves to spend the time with friends. She sometimes still needs a courage and help to finish her task at class. However, she has a desire to complete her task and homework with the best of her and I appreciate it. I wish she will be better and have a good progress for the next level. It has been a pleasure having the oportunity to have you in my class.', '2019-05-31', ''),
	('315091161', '315091', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Cecil enthusiastically participates in any classroom activities. She seems to enjoy working as a group. She has shown noticeable improvement in some but she requires repetion to retain information received from the teachers.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315091162', '315091', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Cecil is a happy student. She can speak english fluently. Paying more attention to her work and less socializing with her friends. Cecil will be able to improve her school work, especialy in math lesson.', '2016-12-14', '9'),
	('315091163', '315091', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Cecil is an active students. she can speak english well. She needs to be encouraged to work move slowly and accurately. Overall, she is a good student. Keep up the good work!', '2017-03-22', NULL),
	('315091164', '315091', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Cecil is a capable student. She speaks with confident and often gives perceptive comments in class discussion. We need continue working on her basic skills to build a stronger foundation in Math. Keep up the good work, Cecil!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315091171', '315091', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Cecil is a happy student. She makes friends easily, however she should manage herself for something she does not like. She makes an effort to study, however she needs more exercise to improve her ability. I hope she can be better for next term.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315091172', '315091', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Cecil is a nice student. She enjoys spending time with friends however she needs to control her feeling about her friendship. She can be sensitive because of that thing. Other things she needs to do are to improve her studies by concentrating and have more practice at home. Good luck,Cecil!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315091173', '315091', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Cecil is a happy student and enjoy to spend time with friends in the class. She needs more exercises and focus during the class. She also needs gain her confidence to do the exercises or even answer the questions from the teachers. Do your best for the last term, Cecil!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315091174', '315091', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Cecil has had courageus to asks questions or seek clarification when needed. She needs more study to understand the Math basic concept, specially in word problems. However, she has improve her confidence to come to the front of the class to answer the questions on board. Keep doing your best, Cecil!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315091181', '315091', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Cecil is a polite student, she show her spirit to study. She has been progressing in Matematika. She needs to improve her time management in doing the task. More encouragement at home will help her to get a better result. Keep trying your best, Cecil!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315091183', '315091', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Cecil is a quite active learner in the class. She asks questions or seeks clarification when needed. We still ancourage her to do her school works carefully. However, she has done her best effort in every single assignment. Keep improving and learning, Cecil!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315092161', '315092', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Rifa shows improvement in several subjects, though he needs to be encouraged to exhibit the use of English in class activities. He can communicate his understanding well. Keep your spirit Rifa!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315092162', '315092', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Rifa is an enjoyable student. The teachers still need to encourage him to submit his work on time.', '2016-12-14', '12'),
	('315092163', '315092', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Rifa is a happy student. He seems to show his interest in science. He enjoys the stories he reads. Paying move attention to his work and less gozialization with his friends, will giude him to improve his school work.', '2017-03-22', NULL),
	('315092164', '315092', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'We are pleased to inform you that there has been a noticeable improvement in Rifa s \nfocus and concentration. He has been paying attention in class and showing interest in his school work. It has been a pleasure to have Rifa in our class. Keep on going Rifa!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315092171', '315092', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rifa shows respect to the teachers and friends. He is able to adapt to new situation. He demonstrates his attempt to always speak English at school. However, his speed and accuracy will improve greatly if he memorizes his basic multiplication and division facts. \r\nKeep doing your best, Rifa!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315092172', '315092', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rifa shows good work this term. He shows enthusiasm for classroom activities. He has good basic skill in Math, however he needs to pay more attention during the lesson. Keep up your good work, Rifa!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315092173', '315092', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rifa is able to work independently. He works very well with his group. However, he needs to pay attention during the lesson and complete assignments with quality of mind. Be cool, be clever, Rifa!\r\n', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315092174', '315092', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'He has a quality of a leader. He shows interest for classroom activities and seems to enjoy learning. He is willing to consider teacherÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s advice for his better performance. Stay positive and keep growing, Rifa! \r\n', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315092181', '315092', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Rifa has done well in some subject, but he has difficulty in Matematika. He needs more focus and active on Matematika in order to be get better comprehension and work. He enjoys spending time with friends and loves having lunch together with other male students.', '2018-10-12', NULL),
	('315092183', '315092', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Rifa shows good progress in his studies so far. He gets good score because he studies well at class. Keep studying at home to maintain your ability and gets better score in the end of the semester. Keep it up, Rifa!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315092184', '315092', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'It has been a pleasure having the oportunity to have Rifa in my class. He has good sense of religious area. He has done his Sima\'an in this grade 5th and being part of Marawis team at school. He has good progress report over the year, however he needs study harder in order to be the best in the class. I do really wish he could be better for the next level. ', '2019-05-31', ''),
	('315093161', '315093', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Clara is a respectful student. She needs to be encouraged to work more slowly and accurately. Overall, she is a good student. Keep up the good work!\r\n\r\n', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315093162', '315093', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Clara is a nice student. She still needs to he more active in class. The teaches still need to encorage her to be more focus on her lessons. Good luck, Clara !', '2016-12-14', '7'),
	('315093163', '315093', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Clara is a nice girl. Added effort and attention on her part could rise her math grade. Study hard Clara !', '2017-03-22', NULL),
	('315093164', '315093', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Clara is having good performance in following classroom rules. She needs to improve in Math, she needs to continue to practice about multiplication. Keep on going Clara!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315093171', '315093', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'She is a nice and polite student. She demonstrates initiative to help. She shows her enthusiasm to learn. Moreover, she also shows her perseverance and confidence to present her projects. \r\nKeep up your good work, Clara! \r\n\r\n', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315093172', '315093', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Clara shows respect to the teachers and peers. She shows enthusiasm for classroom activities. She seems enjoy learning. She has done good work this term. Always do your best, Clara!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315093173', '315093', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Clara always demonstrates hard work to complete daily works and assignments. She seems to enjoy spending time with a few friends. However, stay focus on the lesson will be beneficial for her. Keep up your good work, Clara!\r\n', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315093174', '315093', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has been a pleasure to have Clara in our class this year. She is a nice, calm and polite student. She is committed to doing her best. We appreciate that she is confident to express her thought verbally. Keep growing and showing your perseverance, Clara! \r\n', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315093181', '315093', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Clara is quiet student, she is able to join in a small group of level but Clara needs to encourage herself to speak up and active in learning process. She needs improvement in Mathematics and Matematika accuracy. Keep the spirit to study, Clara!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315093183', '315093', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Clara is a nice student. She is excited in learning. She tries to do her best for her school work. She still feels not confident to do her school work independently. Staying focus and pay more attention on the lesson will deliver her to a better result. Keep practicing and trying, Clara!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315094161', '315094', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Hafizh is a nice boy, he is now really excited helping his friend. He just needs to be more focus while studying. Reviewing and remembering what had been taught is needed for him to improve his academic performance. Be better and more active in classroom Hafizh!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315094162', '315094', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Hafizh shows improvement in several subjects  needs to be encouraged to exhibit the use of English in class activities. Keep improving your self, Hafizh!\r\n', '2016-12-16', NULL),
	('315094164', '315094', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B-', 'Hafizh is an active boy. Sometimes he faces difficulty in participating during lesson and class discussion. ItÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s important that he learns to be a good listener and focus more on paying attention. We hope he can improve his discipline in following the class discussion and rules. Good luck, Hafizh!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315094171', '315094', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Hafizh is an active student. He is helpful.  He needs to be encouraged to concentrate and stay focused on the task. However, he needs to manage his feelings and emotions well in the classroom. \r\nYou can do better, Hafizh!\r\n\r\n', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315094172', '315094', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Hafizh has done good work this term. He pays more attention during the lesson. However, he still needs to pay attention to detail on his assignments. He also needs to be more confident to speak up. You can do more than you think,  Hafizh!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315094173', '315094', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Hafiz shows his enthusiasm for school activities. He demonstrates good work on the test. He works well with his group but he seems to have difficulties to work with other students. Pay more attention during the lesson will be beneficial for him.  You can do more, Hafiz!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315094174', '315094', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Hafizh shows his willingness to be a leader and help teachers. He has a good confidence to perform his interest. He needs to listen and follow directions carefully during class time. Stay positive and keep learning, Hafizh!\r\n\r\n', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315094181', '315094', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Hafizh has a good knowledge in religius area. He is a good muslim and does good things as he is in Mushola. However, he should be more active at class to ask questions or seek clarification when needed. I hope he can be better for next term.', '2018-10-12', NULL),
	('315094183', '315094', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Hafizh is a good boy who loves to sing sholawat or recite Al-Qur\'an at Mushola in Dhuha prayer. He is able to get a better score at class, but lacks of attention. He should be more focus and follow the direction. Keep it up till the end of the semester, Hafizh!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315094184', '315094', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'It has been a pleasure having the oportunity to have Hafizh in my class. He has good sense of religious area. He has done his Sima\'an in this grade 5th and loves being part of Marawis team at school. However, he sometimes still needs help and courage to finish his task well and also on time. I do really hope he can study harder for the next level and have better academic skill. Keep it up, Hafizh.', '2019-05-31', ''),
	('315095161', '315095', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Dino needs guidance in learning. He has to be more active in the classroom. Reviewing and remembering what had been taught is needed for him to improve his academic performance. He also needs to pay attention when the teacher teach in the classroom. Do not give up trying, congratulation on your success!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315095162', '315095', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Dino is an enjoyable student. Added effort and attention his part could rise his English and math grades and strengthen his other academic subjects\r\n', '2016-12-16', NULL),
	('315095164', '315095', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Dino is struggling in most of subjects. Please continue to provide help and support at home until he can work move independently.', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315095171', '315095', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Dino is  a nice student. He makes friends easily. He needs to improve his overall studies however he has studied hard at home and school. He also needs to improve his fluency on reading and writing. I hope he can be better for next term.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315095172', '315095', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Dino is a nice boy. He has a sence of humor that is quite enyoyable in the classroom. He is having trouble in several subjects although he is trying his hardest to improve. He still needs full guidance to help him with his lack of study. I really hope he can improve his ability for the next semester. Good luck, Dino!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315095173', '315095', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Dino is able to make friends quickly and enjoy spending time with fellows. He needs to increase his abilities and follow directions carefully. He needs to apply himself more to all area of study in order to meet the minimum standard for his class level. Be better for the last term, Dino!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315095174', '315095', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Dino has done his best in the class, however he sometimes needs more courage, motivated, and guide to help him meet the minimum standard requirements for his grade level. I do really hope he can be better than this grade. Chin up and always do your best, Dino!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315095181', '315095', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Slow but sure. Maybe those words can describe about Dino. He slowly gains his ability in several subject, however he still has difficulties during the class. I do really hope he can continues his study at home to keep gaining his ability.', '2018-10-12', NULL),
	('315095183', '315095', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Dino is a good student who loves sharing his experience to others, particulary to male-friends. At class, he needs to be more active if he has any difficulties on his studies, so the teacher or even friends can help him. Keep studying, Dino!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315095184', '315095', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Dino is a nice student and loves spending time with friends, particulary at break time. He loves sharing his ideas and experiences. Even though he gets average score at class, he keeps studying at home and I appreciate it. Do not give up, Dino. Keep studying and always do your best. I am sure you will become a great person one day and you have to believe it. It has been a pleasure having the oportunity to have you in my class.', '2019-05-31', ''),
	('315096161', '315096', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Isabell is progressing well in all areas. She could improve by slowing down and taking more care in her work.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315096162', '315096', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Isabella has been concientious about getting her work done and turned on time. She needs to avold work more carefuly to careless mistakes.', '2016-12-14', '2'),
	('315096164', '315096', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Isabella is a joy to teach, she is always on time and is very eager to learn. She has made improvement in some lessons. Isabel makes friends quickly and is well liked by classmates. We believe that her self confidence is improving and is directly affecting her academic performance. Well done, Isabell!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315096171', '315096', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Isabel is polite, kind, and well mannered. She is an active participant in class discussions and knows the answer when called upon. She complete daily assigments in a timely manner. Keep it up, Isabel!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315096172', '315096', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Isabel is a nice girl. She is polite, kind, and well-mannered. She makes an effort to learn at class. She sometimes uses her spare time to continue unfinish assignment. She enjoys learning about new things and reading stories. As the year progresses, she is showing great mark. Keep it up, girl!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315096173', '315096', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Isabel has a great attitude toward learning and wiling to take direction and construction when needed. She is constantly increasing her skills in every subject. Keep it up till the last term, Isabel!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315096174', '315096', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Isabel has a great attitude towards learning and is always trying her hardest to improve. She has good English skills, is mastering Math concept, and sometimes is helpful to other fellows. While Isabel has shown good progress, I suggest her to continue the learning after school in order to retain what she has learned at school. Keep it up, Isabel!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315096181', '315096', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Isabella is a well mannered learner, she has good ability to understand the lesson. She needs to work more carefully to avoid careless mistakes in school work. You can do it better, Isabella!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315096183', '315096', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Isabel is an easy going girl. She is always willing to help her classmate. She is able to follow the lesson in the class. She needs to be more careful in doing her daily work in the class. You can do better, Isabel!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315098161', '315098', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Zafran shows enthusiasm for classroom activities. He needs to be encourage to accept responsibility for his errors and misbehavior in the classroom. His critical thinking is good but he still needs to improve his attitude. Overall he is kind and helpful to everyone in the classroom. Be better for next term, Zafran!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315098162', '315098', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Zafran is an enjoyable student. He needs to be encouraged to exhibit use of English in class activities. He can communicate his understanding well, keep doing your best, Zafran!\r\n', '2016-12-16', NULL),
	('315098164', '315098', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B-', 'Zafran has made good progress in almost academic areas. HeÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s easy to get distracted that makes his work late. Zafran also needs to improve classroom attitude during all activities with his peers. We believe he will get  more pleasant place if he can make a positive effort in this area. Keep improving, Zafran!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315098171', '315098', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafran is a nice student. He has good concept in Math however he needs constant encouragement on doing daily exercise. He also needs to stay focus during the class and needs to completes daily assignments in a timely manner. I hope he can be better for next term.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315098172', '315098', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zaafran is a good student. He is mastering Math concept and does well in Math class. He needs to learn how to become good listener while he has been performing well. He also needs to follow direction more carefully. Keep it up, Zafran!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315098173', '315098', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafran has good concept in Math and Matematika. It is because he loves it. He needs to increase his ability to listen and follow direction carefully. While he has been performing well, he needs to follow directions more carefully. Be better for the last term, Zafran!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315098174', '315098', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafran\'s strongest work is in Math and Matematika. He does so because he loves it. That is very good, however he needs learn to become a good listener and takes directions well. He also needs to increase his dicipline manner during the lesson. I do really hope he can improve it all and be better for the next grade level. Keep it up, Zafran!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315098181', '315098', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Zafran is friendly student. He can make a friend easily but he has to be more patient when do the exercises at class. Zafran just needs help in Matematika to count accurate and manage his emotion well. Keep spirit, Zafran!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315098183', '315098', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Zafran is an active boy. He needs to be encouraged to exhibit the use of English in class activities. He could have performed better if he could show a better attitude toward other lessons. Besides, he is continuously learning to select what is appropriate to say and do. Keep improving Zafran!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315099161', '315099', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Alif is a nice student. He could have performed better if he pays attention and does his work seriously. Keep your spirit in learning, Alif!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315099162', '315099', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Alif has done a good work this term. He shows his enthusiasm in learning and his best effort on his daily works. On the other hand, he needs to be more focus on the teacherÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s instruction. Keep spirit and be better for next term, Alif!\r\n', '2016-12-16', NULL),
