	('315099173', '315099', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alif is polite to adults and peers in and out the classroom. He seems to have difficulty in citizenship lesson. Having more practice and reading a lot will be beneficial for his self -development. Keep studying hard, Alif!\r\n', '2018-03-23', ''),
