	('315100161', '315100', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Ridwan shows a constant progress this term. He needs to be more carefully in doing his work as he still does some mistakes for he does  not read the instruction of question carefully. Do your best for the next term, Ridwan!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315100162', '315100', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Ridwan is able to separate work and social times. He tries his best to complete his task. He shows a good attitude towards homeworks and tasks. Keep up the good work, Ridwan!\r\n', '2016-12-16', NULL),
	('315100164', '315100', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'This is the last semester for him to learn in primary three, so far he has made some improvement in following the lessons. Ridwan has missed a couple of days in this semester in learning these absence are effecting his academic performance. Keep doing the good work, Ridwan!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315100171', '315100', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ridwan is a nice student. He makes friends easily and loves sharing and spending time with friends. Basically, he is a smart student, sometimes he does not believe in himself. However, he needs to improve his concentration skills in the class. I hope he can be better next term.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315100172', '315100', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ridwan is a nice student. He shares his ideas to the class confidently. He is working well with others and pleasant to the teacher. However he sometimes needs encouragement on doing exercises at class. He also needs to improve his overall work habits and concentration skills. Keep it up, Boy!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315100173', '315100', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ridwan s handwriting needs to be improved to meet the standard of grade level. He does well in overall subjects, however he needs more effort and confidence to answer the questions. He is capable of producing better work if he puts more focus and concentration on his work.', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315100174', '315100', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ridwan is capable of producing better works, he only needs to be focus during the class and concentrate harder on his work. He sometimes is easy to give up, however he can do it by himself. Always believe in yourself and do the best things you have. Keep it up, Ridwan!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315100181', '315100', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', '', '2018-12-10', NULL),
	('315101161', '315101', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Aisyah gets along well with her peers. She does her work at her own pace, but she is able to finish her assignments. She needs to be encouraged to show her best performance. Your constant cooperation and help are really helpful for her. Never give up, Aisyah!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315101162', '315101', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Aisyah is a respectful student. She needs to take more time and care in competing her assignments. However, with her enthisiasm and sincerity, We are sure will develop greater stability. We appreciate the patience and support on your end.', '2016-12-14', '22'),
	('315101164', '315101', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'She is struggling in math. She does not seem to enjoy it all. Perhaps the material is too difficult. Please continue to provide help and support at home until she can work independently.', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315101171', '315101', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Aisyah shows willingness to learn and complete daily work. She is learning to speak more English at school. Moreover, she needs help to increase academic skills such as Math, Science and Matematika. Do your best, Aisyah!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315101172', '315101', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Aisyah shows her perseverance on completing her tasks. She respects her teachers and peers. She also enjoys spending time with friends during free periods. However, she still needs enrichment in academic areas. Keep doing your best, Aisyah!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315101173', '315101', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Aisyah is cheerful and friendly. She is still struggling with some lessons.  She needs to memorize basic Math multiplication and work hard to spell the word correctly. Do your best and never give up, Aisyah!\r\n', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315101174', '315101', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Aisyah shows respect for teachers and peers. She is always kind to others. She struggles to understand the lesson and still needs to work hard to raise her grade.Trust yourself that you can achieve more, Aisyah!\r\n', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315101181', '315101', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Aisyah is kind and well mannered learner. She is having a lot of difficulties with high frequency words. She needs to practice more in the basic math and Matematika required in her grade. She will get better result if she practices more at home. Keep on trying, Aisyah!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315101183', '315101', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Aisyah shows respect to the teachers. She puts sincere effort to accomplish the project and works hard in the class. Sometimes she demonstrates a need for direct supervision to complete work. Keep learning, Aisyah!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315102161', '315102', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Zahra seems to lose her motivation. She urgently needs to manage her time wisely, but Zahra is a nice girl. Keep trying and practicing at home. Keep up the good work!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
