	('315102174', '315102', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zahra has made a good academic progress during the class. She puts evident effort into her work, however she needs more practice to gain and even increas her abilities. I hope she stays focus during the lessons and on getting work done in the time alloted. Keep doing your best, Zahra!', '2018-06-08', ''),
