	('315106164', '315106', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Carissa is a polite and friendly member of the class. She has ability to get along with others. Academically she has a great capability in understanding materials although sometimes she feels unconfident. It has been pleasure to teach her. I wish her well in the future!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315106171', '315106', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has been a pleasure getting to know Caca in my class. She is a nice and an enthusiastic learner. She has a good spoken English. She also masters Math concept easily, however she needs to be more careful on doing the exercise. Well done, Caca!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315106172', '315106', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Caca is a smart girl. She is showing good growth in basic skills. She is mastering Math concept easily and she loves challenge. She is also an active participant during the class. She puts evident effort into her work as she completes assignments in quality in mind. one thing that she must concern is be careful on her careless mistakes.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315106173', '315106', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Caca is a joy to have in the class. She is eager to learn and sometimes ask for challenges in the class. She is a thoughtful student and respects the opinions of others. She sometimes asks for clarification if she has problems with the exercises. Do your best for last term, Caca!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315106174', '315106', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Caca has a great attitude towards learning and is willing to take direction and construction when needed. She has a good English pronunciation, knowing the Math basic concept, solve the problem independently, and also a joy to have in the class. I wish she could have more practice to maintain and even gain her ability to compete with other students. Keep it up, Caca!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315106181', '315106', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Caca works independently and stays on task. She is an easy going student that only does her best. I do really wish that she could have a target and satisfaction on what she does. Overall, she does well in all subjects. Keep it up, Caca!', '2018-10-12', NULL),
	('315106183', '315106', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Carissa is a humble student. She has good social skills to other friends and sometimes shares her ideas. She is an independent student who can study well by her own ways. Keep it up, Carissa!', '2019-03-22', ''),
