	('315107164', '315107', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Farrel is able to relate his teacher and class mom. He has no problem in socializing and has no problem with others. In his academic performance, he still needs to make steady progress in both his reading and writing skill. Farrel is pleasant and friendly a pleasure to have him around. Keep it up Farrel!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315107171', '315107', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Farel is a quite student at the class, however he makes friends easily and enjoys spending time with friends. Some areas he should improve are his focus and his confidence to be more active at the class. I hope he can be better for next term.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315107172', '315107', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Farrel is a good student. He enjoys spending time with friends and treats them fairly. He has known basic Math facts, but he must improve Math word problems concept. He has also gained his confidence at class. He dares to come in front of the class to answer the questions. I wish he can improve his abilities by keep studying and always do his best for every subject. ', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315107173', '315107', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Farrel was shy at first, however he is gaining his self-confidence within the class. He does well in class, however, he needs more focus and decrease his playing during the lesson. I hope he can be better for the last term.', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315107174', '315107', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Farrel needs to increase his ability more to all areas of study to meet better score for his grade level. He also should increase his dicipline manner on submit the task. He has done well in all subject, he only needs more practice to maintain and even increase his ability. Always do your best, Farrel!', '2018-06-08', ''),
