	('315108171', '315108', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ziyad shows perseverance to accomplish his projects. He has insightful ideas to share with friends. However, his speed and accuracy will improve greatly if he memorizes his basic multiplication and division facts. \r\nYou can do better, Ziyad!\r\n\r\n', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315108172', '315108', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ziyad seems to have strength in Religion area. He can memorize surah and Arabic easily. He can perform himself to retell the story with impressive expression and intonation. However, he needs to work at an appropriate pace. Keep up your good work,  Ziyad!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
