	('315109161', '315109', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Fito seems to lose his motivation at learning. He is very calm in the classroom. It is highly recommended for him to build his confidence. Keep trying to do your best, Fito!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
