	('315109171', '315109', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fito is nice and polite. He works independently and stays on task. Sometimes, he forgets his book or homework. However, he needs to work better on the test. \r\nDo your best, Fito!\r\n\r\n', '2017-10-13', NULL),
