	('315119173', '315119', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ardas is an active participant in class discussion. He puts evident effort into his work as he completes assignments with quality of mind. He needs to react properly of something that he has seen or heard.Stay fabulous, Ardas!\r\n', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315119174', '315119', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has been a pleasure having the opportunity to work with Ardas during his 4th grade year. He consistently shows his best effort on his work. He has an impressive understanding and depth of knowledge about his interests. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing, Ardas!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315119181', '315119', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Ardas listens and follows direction well. He has good knowledge of some lessons and shares the information to others. He is also an active participant in class discussions. He shows perseverance in all he does. I hope he can continue his best things in the class.', '2018-10-12', NULL),
