	('315119184', '315119', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Ardas continues to have a great year in 5th grade. He gets the best score for English and Science in the class. He always knows the answer when called upon. I wish he could maintain his ability till the next grade and be the best also. It has been a pleasure having the oportunity to have you in my class.', '2019-05-31', ''),
	('315120161', '315120', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Audra needs guidance in learning. She has to be more active in the classroom. Reviewing and remembering what had been taught is needed for her to improve her academic performance. She also needs to pay more attention when the teacher teach in the classroom. Keep on trying, congratulation on your success, Audra!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315120162', '315120', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Audra is polite, kind and always willing to help a classmate. She hurries throught work and make careless mistake. All the practice and encouragement she can get at home will help in her class. Good luck, Audra!\r\n', '2016-12-16', NULL),
