	('315120171', '315120', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Audra is a cheerful and active girl. She has good confidence to speak up and present her works. However, she still needs to improve spelling in written work and put more effort on her assignment. \r\nKeep up your spirit, Audra!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
