	('315130174', '315130', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Pasha does well in the class, however he needs to improve his concentration and motivated during the lesson. He sometimes is easy to surender on what he cannot solve, however he only needs time to think again and correct the mistakes. I hope he could practice more at home to increase his abilities and get a better mark for his assigment. Always do your best, Pasha!', '2018-06-08', ''),
