	('315131181', '315131', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Rifqy is a good student. She has a good knowledge in religius area and it can be seen when he joins tahfidz and stays at Mushola. He does well in overall subjects, but he still needs to gain his ability specifically for Matematika and IPA. Keep it up, Rifqy!', '2018-10-12', NULL),
