	('315133173', '315133', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Nada is a dedicated worker and is eager to learn in all subjects. She has worked very hard for her high marks and is showing constant improvement. I hope she could maintain or even gain her abilities till the end of semester. Kep it up, Nada!', '2018-03-23', ''),
