	('315139162', '315139', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Almira arrives at school each day with smile and is ready to study. However, she is one of playful students in the classroom. She enjoys spending time with friends. So she needs guidance to be discipline in the learning activities.', '2016-12-16', '15'),
	('315139163', '315139', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Almira has a good sociability. She makes friends easily and enjoys spending time with friends. Yet, she is very quiet in learning activity. She needs a guidance to be discipline in the learning activities both at school and also at home. So, she can improve her academic performance.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315139164', '315139', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Almira is a quiet girl in the class but she is active while playing with her friends. She is actually easy to understand something if she wants to focus and confident to express her idea. But she is hard to focus on learning and would rather think of other things like playing. In the next grade, Almira should pay more attention to academic ability and also tasks given by teachers in order to get maximum results.', '2017-06-15', '12'),
	('315139171', '315139', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It is a pleasure to have Almira in our class. During this mid-semester, she has strengthened her skills especially in reading and writing in English. Still, she needs more practice to comprehend the texts she reads. She also needs to encourage herself to lessen her abseenteism so that she can study more regularly. Keep up the spirit, Almira!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315139172', '315139', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Almira still needs commitment and effort while doing her work under direct supervision. She also needs more repetition and practice in order to retain what she has learned, especially in Math and Science lesson. Spending more of her free time at home to review the lessons would benefit her to receive a greater achievement. Keep up the spirit, Almira!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315139173', '315139', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Almira is a caring student who likes helping her friends. She just needs to be more focused while doing her work so that she is able to work faster and complete her work in the alloted time. She also needs more practice in Math lesson. We believe she can do it when she tries harder. Keep trying, Almira!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315139174', '315139', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Almira is a nice student. She needs to stay focused in everything that she is doing. She needs to improve her focus to follow teachers\' instructions. You can do better, Almira!', '2018-06-08', ''),
