	('315157163', '315157', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Anisa is cooperative and well mannered. Actually she can grasp the lesson fast. Yet, on this second term, she likes not to focus on the lesson. Focusing more her attention in learning activities will give her a better progress in her study. So, keep up your achievement, Nisa!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315157164', '315157', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Anisa is good and like to socialize with her friends. She also likes to help them. Anisa easily understands her lessons, but sometimes she likes to be less focused in learning and still chatting with her close friends. Hopefully in the next grade, Anisa can focus more on learning and reduce her chat while the teacher is explaining.', '2017-06-15', '8'),
	('315157171', '315157', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anisa is a nice student. Up to this mid-semester, she is able to grasp the materials very well. She just needs to be more focused while doing her work so that she is able to work faster and complete her work in the alloted time. Keep up the good work, Anisa!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315157172', '315157', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anisa continues to make nice progress this term. She comprehends the materials learned very well. She is a conscientious student who is keen to work hard and do her best in completing the tasks. We hope this fine report will continue in the next term. Keep up the good work, Anisa!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315157173', '315157', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anisa is a nice student. She always likes to be part of every classroom activities and always completes daily tasks. Somehow, she has to be very careful with her work. She also needs to focus during lesson time for better scores. Keep up the good work, Anisa!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315157174', '315157', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Anisa is a responsible student and knows how to follow rules in class. She shows a great deal of interest in learning the lessons. She actively participates in the class. You\'re doing a good job, Anisa!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315157181', '315157', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Anisa is a responsible student and up to this mid-semester she is able to grasp the materials very well. She is an independent girl who has great sense of responsibillity in completing the tasks given. Keep up the good work, Anisa!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315157183', '315157', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Anisa is able to work individually and stay on task. She is cheerful and talented. She is also willing to lend a hand. However, being more focused on the lesson will be beneficial for her. Keep up your wonderful things, Anisa!\r\n', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315158153', '315158', '2015/2016', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Andika is a clever student. He has good creativity in making art work. He has improved his independence in taking care of himself. He has good understanding in grammar however still needs to improve his speaking skill. In this term, he is careless in doing his daily works and assignments. \nWe are so proud of all you have accomplished, Andika!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315158161', '315158', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Andika is a cooperative and fast learner. He has made great progress in academic and social aspects since the beginning of the school year. However the following challenges will come. Keep up the good work!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
