	('315158173', '315158', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Andika has done a very nice job this term, taking pride in his work and completing assignments with quality in mind. Good job, Andika!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315158174', '315158', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Andika has shown great perseverence and consistency on all of his efforts on his study in this academic year. We are proud of his achivement. Hopefully in the next level Andika will keep his eager to succed. Well done, Andika!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315158181', '315158', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Andika shows an impressive knowledge in the 4th grade. He keeps working independently and he is frequently among the first to help and mentor other classmates. He is a valuable part of the classroom. Keep shining, the future leader!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315158183', '315158', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Andika takes responsibility for his learning well. He commits to do his best and sets an example of excellence in behavior and cooperation. He also likes to help his classmates and teachers. Keep showing your bets, Andika!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315159153', '315159', '2015/2016', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Aurel is an independent learner. She is willing to help her classmates. She is able to tell story. She has good understanding in Science and Math. She is enthusiastic to give her best performance and she has qualities of leadership.\nKeep doing your best, Aurel!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315159161', '315159', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Aurel always puts evident effort into her work as she completes assignments. She has done a very nice job this term. However, she is a shy and quiet person in the classroom. She needs to manage her feelings and emotions better. \r\nKeep up your achievements, Aurel!', '2016-10-14', '3'),
	('315159162', '315159', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin ', 'C', 'Aurelia shows enthusiasm for learning activities. She has made some progress in her study since the beginning of school year. I am confident the next one will be even better. She just needs to be more active in the classroom. Study harder, Aurel!', '2016-12-16', '3'),
	('315159163', '315159', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Aurelia has a pleasant personality. She likes to share her knowledge to the others. Furthermore, she is smart and able to answers teachersÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢ questions well. Yet, she lacks independence and needs to be motivated. ', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315159164', '315159', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Aurelia is a good, obedient and clever student. It is shown with her achievements in this second grade. However, Aurel should be more focused while studying and not chatting with friends while studying. Aurel should also pay more attention to the school tasks assigned by the teacher.', '2017-06-15', '6'),
	('315160153', '315160', '2015/2016', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Devan has made good progress in this term. He has improved his handwriting. He has shown good result in his final test but he still needs to improve his writing skill. He also has to work independently in the class.\n Give your best effort in Grade 2, Devan!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315160161', '315160', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Devan has made some progress in his study especially in his writing since the beginning of school year. I am confident the next one will be even better. He just needs guidance in his study. Keep up your achievements, Devan!', '2016-10-14', '15'),
	('315160162', '315160', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Devan is a good student. However, he is not yet active participant in learning activities. He is shy and so quiet. So, doing more active conversation in the learning activities will give hima better progress in his study. Keep on trying, Devan!', '2016-12-16', '16'),
	('315160163', '315160', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Devan is a very happy and well-adjusted child. Actually he enjoys spending time with friends but he gets emotional easily. He needs to manage his feelings and emotions better. Study harder and keep up your achievements, Devan!', '2017-03-22', NULL),
	('315160164', '315160', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Devan has made some progress in his study especially in his writing since the beginning of school year. I am confident the next one will be even better. He just needs guidance in his study. Keep up your achievements, Devan!', '2017-06-15', '16'),
	('315160171', '315160', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Up to this mid-semester, Devan has shown good enthusiasm in completing the tasks given. He just needs to be more focused while doing his work so that he is able to work faster and complete her work in the alloted time. He also needs more practice to produce clear-neat writing. We believe he can do it when he tries harder. Keep trying, Devan!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315160172', '315160', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Devan still needs commitment and effort while doing his work under direct supervision. He also needs more repetition and practice in order to retain what he has learned, especially in Math lesson. Spending more of his free time at home to review the lessons would benefit him to receive a greater achievement. Keep up the spirit, Devan!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315160173', '315160', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Devan enjoys being in school. He shows great improvement this semester. However, he has to improve his motor skills especially in hand writing. He also needs to finish his tasks on time. Keep up the good work, Devan!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315160174', '315160', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Devan is a very energetic student. He is able to separate lesson and social times. He is also kind to his classmates and always ready to help others. However, he needs encouragement to control his feeling when he has a different opinion from his friends\' opinion. Never stop trying, Devan!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315160181', '315160', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Devan shows willingness to learn in the class. He has shown good ability to understand the lessons and work independently. However, he needs to put care into his daily writing work. Keep improving, Devan! Always believe yourself', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315160183', '315160', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Devan is a calm boy. He needs a constant encouragement in all areas. He has a good basic knowledge and he is able to achieve more if he puts his best effort.  You can do better, Devan!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315161153', '315161', '2015/2016', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Brian has good ability to understand the lessons. He needs to focus and concentrate during the lesson. He is still careless in writing and counting.  However, he needs to improve his skill in using his class time more effectively.\nGive your best effort in Grade 2, Brian!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315161161', '315161', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Brian arrives at school each day with a smile and is ready to study. However, he is one of playful students in the classroom. He enjoys spending time with friends. So he needs guidance to be discipline in the learning activities.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315161162', '315161', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Brian needs to pay more attention in learning activities. He also has to be more active in the classroom. Reviewing and remembering what had been taught is needed for him to improve his academic performance. Study harder, Brian!', '2016-12-16', NULL),
	('315162153', '315162', '2015/2016', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Chalesta is a smart girl.  She speaks English in the class consistently and confidently.  She has good understanding in Science and reading a story. She can tell a story and she enjoys spending time with her friends. However, she still needs to improve her spelling in her writing.\nKeep doing your best, Chalesta!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315162161', '315162', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'fdgdgjk', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315163153', '315163', '2015/2016', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Fabian is an enthusiastic learner.  He has good understanding in Grammar and Science. He is still careless in doing Math and PKN exercises. He is polite and kind to his teachers and friends. \nKeep doing your best, Fabian!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315163161', '315163', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fabian has made great progress in academic and social aspects since the beginning of school year. However to reach the best accomplishment is not a simple thing. Keep attentive and discipline to get it! We believe he can make some aspects better.', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315163162', '315163', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Fabian is an enthusiastic learner who seems enjoying the school. He always complete his tasks on time. He needs paying attention to teacher when the teacher is explaining lesson. He often hurries through his work and makes it not complete well. Be more careful to do your tasks, Fabian!', '2016-12-16', NULL),
	('315163163', '315163', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fabian is showing his best this quarter. He works independently and stays on task. He must be more carefully to play during playtime. Keep improving, Fabian!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315163164', '315163', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Fabian is a good student. Being more discipline will direct him to the good work. He needs  to pay more attention during lesson hours. Keep doing better, Fabian!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315163171', '315163', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fabian has good ability in understanding the materials learned up to this mid-semester. He is an active student who has high motivation to share his opinions and ideas in front of the class. He needs to try to limit his talking and socializing time during the lessons, so that he can learn as much as possible in the class. Keep up the good work, Fabian!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315163172', '315163', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fabian has made good contributions in the class. He comprehends the materials learned very well. He is a conscientious student who is keen to work hard and do his best in completing the tasks. However, recently Fabian tends to do his work hastily so that he sometimes makes minor errors that actually can be fixed by doing double checks towards his work earlier. Keep up the spirit, Fabian!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315163173', '315163', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fabian is a smart student. He can easily grasp comprehend the topics being discussed. Still, sometimes he needs to be reminded to concentrate during the lessons because he is easily distracted. However, he needs to focus on the lesson for better understanding. Keep up the good work, Fabian!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315163174', '315163', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', ' Fabian is an energetic student. He contributes well in class discussions and shows great confidence in front of the class. On the other hand, he should learn to be more careful in expressing his feelings to avoid missunderstanding of others. Keep up the good work, Fabian!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315163181', '315163', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Fabian is a smart student, he has excellent ability in absorbing the materials given. He does not have any difficulties both comprehending the materials in English and Indonesian. He just needs to be more careful in doing his work since sometimes he tends to do his work hastily and it is turning with some careless errors. Keep it up, Fabian!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315163183', '315163', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Fabian enthusiastic learner, he work independently and finishes his work on time. He shows a great deal of interest in learning the lessons. However, Fabian needs to be encouraged to work slowly and neatly for better results. Do your best, Fabian!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315164153', '315164', '2015/2016', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Ghalya shows good progress. She has shown good result in her final test. She needs to improve her discipline and counting ability. She still needs to pay attention in using capital letters. \nGive your best effort in Grade 2, Ghalya!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315164161', '315164', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'hgdtfjhk', '2016-10-14', NULL),
