	('315165161', '315165', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Dhani is an active student. He has shown positive progress during the beginning of the school year. He just needs to control his behavior during playtime and attentive to others. Keep learning!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('315165162', '315165', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Dhani shows good progres this semester. He can share with others. He can learn the material well. However he needs to comply with the school rules, such as no playing inside the classroom and paying attention during leson in class. He needs to be more friendly with the other friends. Keep learning and increase your achievement, Dhani!', '2016-12-16', NULL),
	('315165163', '315165', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Dhani is a good and active student. He needs to always be reminded to complete his daily assignments in a timely manner and return homework on time. Stay focus on lesson will help him achieve excellence. Keep learning and focus, Dhani!', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315165164', '315165', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Dhani is a good student. He needs to be more focus and pays attention during lesson hours. He needs to complete works with quality in mind. Keep study hard, Dhani!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315166153', '315166', '2015/2016', '3', '', '', 'Bintang is a smart student. He has good handwriting. He shows interest in Science and reading books. He enjoys spending time with friends. However he needs to use class time more effectively.\nKeep doing your best, Bintang!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315166161', '315166', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Bintang is an enthusiastic learner. He tackles new challenges seriously and with a positive attitude. He likes to do all his works fast. So, being more careful in doing his works will improve his academic performance. I am so proud of all he has accomplished.', '2016-10-14', '5'),
	('315166162', '315166', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Bintang has good ability to understand the lesson but he needs to concentrate more during the lesson. So focusing more his attention in learning activities in class will give him a better progress in his study. Study harder, Bintang!', '2016-12-16', '4'),
