	('315167163', '315167', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Hammam is a good and fast learner. He has good ability to understand the lesson well. Yet, on this second term, he likes not to pay attention when the teachers are explaining. So focusing more his attention in learning activities in class will give him a better progress in his study.\r\n\r\n', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315167164', '315167', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin ', 'A', 'Hammam is a polite and good student. He is also one of the brightest students in the class. Hammam must maintain his achievements. Do not forget to keep learning and learning.', '2017-06-15', '2'),
	('315168153', '315168', '2015/2016', '3', '', '', 'Evan shows good work on his daily works and assignments. He has good ability in Math but still has difficult concept in complex subtraction.  He makes effort to make his handwriting legible. However, he still needs to improve his spelling ability.\nKeep doing your best, Evan!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315169153', '315169', '2015/2016', '3', '', '', 'Raisya has made good progress this term. Her handwriting is easy to read. She enjoys the stories she reads. She is capable of doing classroom works but rarely turns in homework. However, she still needs constant encouragement.\nYou can do better in Grade 2, Raisya!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315169161', '315169', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Raisya shows a good progress in this term. She makes friends easily and enjoys time with her friends at school. It would be better for her to keep improving her reading and writing skills. We believe that next she will be even better. You can do better, Ais!', '2016-10-14', '14'),
	('315169162', '315169', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Raisya has made some progress in her study especially in his writing since the beginning of school year. I am confident the next one will be even better. She just needs guidance in her study. Moreover, all the practice and encouragement she can get at home will help in her class endeavors. Keep up your achievements, Ais!', '2016-12-16', '13'),
	('315169163', '315169', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Raisya is a very happy and well-adjusted child. She enjoys spending time with friends. Yet she needs to actively participate in classroom discussion.So focusing more her attention in learning activities in class will give her a better progress in her study. She also needs to study harder.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315169164', '315169', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Raisya has shown a better achievement in her learning process at school. She is able to follow the lesson well and expresses her ideas in class. She needs to increase her focus during class activities. Hopefully in the next level, Raisya can be more focus on her lesson and studies harder. So, she gets better achievements.', '2017-06-15', '11'),
	('315169171', '315169', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Raisya is a helpful student who likes to assist the teacher and her friends during the class activities. She needs more improvement in English and Social Studies but she is showing good interest in Math, Computer and Religion. Keep on trying to do the better efforts, Raisya!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315169172', '315169', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Raisya is a respectful student. She is developing to be consistent to finish all assignments in the time given. She needs more motivation to join all class activities. She has shown good progress in English, Science, and Math. Keep on going to be better, Raisya !', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315169173', '315169', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Raisya is an obedient student. She is developing an independent learning as her self concept. She needs more encouragement to join a group discussion. Keep on moving, Raisya!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315169174', '315169', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Raisya has developed her responsibility and confidence during the learning process in this academic year. She has improved in learning Social Studies. She needs more support to do all of her assignments carefully. Keep on doing better, Raisya!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315169181', '315169', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Raisya is a good student. However, I would like to see her settle down more to study attentively in the class. Spending more of her free time to have reading practice at home will benefit her both enhancing her reading comprehension and achieving a greater accomplishment. Keep up the spirit, Raisya!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('315169183', '315169', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Raisya shows her best effort and she has made good achievement. She stays on task with little supervision. Spending more of her free time at home to review the lessons would benefit her to receive a better results. Do your best, Raisya!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315170153', '315170', '2015/2016', '3', '', '', 'Reyhan shows good work on his daily works and assignments. He shows interest in Math and Science. He is polite, kind and well-mannered. He is an active participant in small group discussion. He has good reading skill and chooses book that is at his reading level. \nKeep doing your best, Reyhan!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
