	('315170162', '315170', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Reyhan has done a very nice job this term, taking pride in her work and completing assignments with quality in mind. So, being more active to participate in learning activities will improve his academic performance.  Keep up your achievements, Rey!', '2016-12-16', '6'),
	('315170163', '315170', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Reyhan is cooperative and well mannered. He shows perseverance in all he does.  He is an active participant in small or large group discussionsHowever, itwould be better for him to study harder and keep improving his achievement.', '2017-03-24', NULL),
	('315170164', '315170', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Reyhan is always eager to learn. He also always tries to finish his tasks perfectly, Reyhan get a little difficulty in Math. Hopefully in the next level Reyhan keeps eager in learning and gets better achievements.', '2017-06-15', '5'),
	('315170171', '315170', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Reyhan is a nice student who obeys the classroom rules. He shows enthusiasm while doing all classroom activities. He follows teacher directions well. He shows good English practising. He needs to be consistent to understand the Math concept. Keep up the good efforts, Reyhan!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315170172', '315170', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Reyhan is an enthusiastic learner who seems to enjoy studying at school. He is able to cooperate consistently with the teachers and other students. He puts effort into his work as he completes assignments with quality in mind. Keep up the good work, Reyhan !', '2017-12-19', NULL),
