	('315170183', '315170', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Reyhan is a polite and cheerful student. He is obedient and reliable. He often displays and talks about personal items from home when they relate to topics of study. He needs to work more carefully to make a wonderful result. Go achieve more, Reyhan!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315171153', '315171', '2015/2016', '3', '', '', 'Zafira is a smart student.  She is capable of doing classroom works but rarely turns in homeworks. However, she still needs to manage her class time better.\nYou can do better in Grade 2, Zafira!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
	('315171161', '315171', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafira is a good student. She also can manage her feelings and emotion well in the classroom. However, she is not yet active participant in learning activities. She is shy and so quiet. So, doing more active conversation in the learning activities will give her a better progress in her study. Keep on trying, Zafira!', '2016-10-14', '9'),
	('315171162', '315171', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafira is a good student. She begins to show good progress in her study. She tries to speak English actively in the class even though it is very hard for her. Yet, I believe on her.  If she keeps trying on it, she can be better. Study harder, Zafira!', '2016-12-16', '9'),
	('315171163', '315171', '2016/2017', '3', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Zafira has good ability to understand the lesson but she needs to concentrate more during the lesson. She also needs guidance in her study.So focusing more her attention in learning activities in class will give her a better progress in her study.Moreover, all the practice and encouragement she can get at home will help in her class endeavors.', '2017-03-22', NULL),
	('315171164', '315171', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafira is a quiet student. She also sometimes does not focus on her study. Hopefully in the next level,Zafira can be active to share her ideas in learning process. Moreover, she studies harder to get better achievements.', '2017-06-15', '14'),
	('315171171', '315171', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafira is an obedient student who seems to be calm during the learning process. She is developing her concentration skills and English skills. She needs to be encouraged to understand the teacher instruction and express her own ideas clearly. She needs to be consistent to understand the Math concept. Keep on moving, Zafira!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315171172', '315171', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafira is a quiet student. She is developing to be active in joining all class activities. She is able to retell the story from the storybook that she reads well. She needs more support in her motivation study to gain her academic work. Keep on trying to make a better effort, Zafira ! ', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315171173', '315171', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafira is an obedient student. She needs more encouragement to be independent as her self concept. She also needs to improve her consistence to finish all assignments on time and motivation to learn Math. Keep on trying to do better, Zafira!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315171174', '315171', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zafira has shown her confidence during the learning process in this academic year. She has improved in understanding Math concept. She has good interest in Indonesian Language and Social Studies. She needs encouragement to express her ideas. Keep up the good efforts, Zafira!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315171181', '315171', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', ' Zafira basically has a good knowledge. However, she needs a reminder to use time wisely to finish tasks in the time required. She also needs to be encouraged to express her thought well. Believe yourself that you can do more, Zafira!', '2018-10-12', ''),
