	('315172173', '315172', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Calya enjoys making craft. She seems to enjoy spending time and working together  with a few friends. Being more responsible to complete the project and pay more attention will be good for her. You can do better, Calya !', '2018-03-23', ''),
