	('315172181', '315172', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Calya is a nice student. She has good knowledge of art and music. She loves reading and drawing and sometimes spending her spare time with those activity. She does well in overall subject. Keep it up Calya.', '2018-10-12', NULL),
