	('315172184', '315172', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'It has been a pleasure having the oportunity to have Calya in my class. She is a nice and creative student. She has good art expreesion, particulary in drawing and coloring. She also usually brings her drawing utensils into the class and shares to friends who loves drawing and coloring too. She has good english speaking skill, but sometimes has a little misspelling on the writing. Keep all the best of you, Calya.', '2019-05-31', ''),
	('315173153', '315173', '2015/2016', '3', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Azka has made good progress this term. He has improved his reading skill. However, he still needs constant encouragement especially in English and Science. He also needs to be more responsible with his stuffs and works.\nYou can do better, Azka!\n', '2016-03-24', NULL),
