	('315173162', '315173', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Azka is a good student. He tries to finish his tasks well. He needs more practice to understand the concept in English and Math subject. Keep learning and increase your achievement, Azka!', '2016-12-16', NULL),
