	('315173164', '315173', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Azka has tried his best this term. He speaks very well in the class. He is a good listener. He needs to improve his lessons, especially in Math. Keep learning, Azka!', '2017-06-15', NULL),
	('315173171', '315173', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Up to this mid-semester, Azka has shown good enthusiasm in completing the tasks given. He just needs to be more focused while doing his work so that he is able to work faster and complete his work in the alloted time. He also needs practice to comprehend the texts he reads. We believe he can do it when he tries harder. Keep trying, Azka ', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315173172', '315173', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Azka still needs commitment and effort while doing his work under direct supervision. He should become more self-motivated to do his work in full concentration so that he can get better results. Spending more of his free time at home to review the lessons would benefit him to receive a greater achievement.  Keep up the spirit, Azka!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315173173', '315173', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Azka is a good student. However, I would like to see him settle down more to study attentively in the class. Spending more of his free time to have reading practice at home will benefit him both to enhance his reading comprehension and to achieve a greater accomplishment. Keep up the spirit, Azka!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315173174', '315173', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Azka is very helpful to teachers and classmates. He is also a good leader and humble student. He knows how to separate work and social times. However, he needs to be encouraged to improve his eagerness to achieve his best potential. Keep on trying, Azka!', '2018-06-08', ''),
