	('315179172', '315179', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Up to the end of this first semester, Ghaliya continues to make nice progress. She is eager to achieve her goals and willing to complete all assignments we give at school. She can improve her accuracy by remembering to review her work in order to get the best results. Keep up the good work, Ghaliya!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
