	('315181171', '315181', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Chika is a nice student. She makes friends easily and enjoys spending time with friends. However, she sometimes less confidence when clled upon the class. She needs more effort to increase her ability in order to get good score in her daily work and test. Be better for next term, Chika!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315181172', '315181', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Chika is a good student. She is capable of producing better work, all she must do is concentrate harder on her work. She needs to be more active and improve her confidence to share her opinion during the class. Overall, she has done good for this semester.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315181173', '315181', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Chika is a pleasant student and is working well with others. She needs more effort and focus during the lesson in order to gain her abilities. She has no hesitate to ask the teacher if she has any difficulties during the lesson. I hope she can be better for the last term.', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315181174', '315181', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'While Chika has been performing well overall, she still needs more effort and practice at home to gain her abilities. She needs stay focus during the class and concentrate harder on her work habits. Always do your best, Chika!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315181181', '315181', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Chika listens and follows directions well during the class. She makes an effort to learn at class. She does well in overall subjects, but she has difficulties in Matematika and IPA. I hope she could be better for the next term.', '2018-10-12', NULL),
	('315181183', '315181', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Chika is a good student who can demonstrate a good muslimah outfit for her friends. She also does well at class and gets good score in overall subjects. She is able to separate work and social time at class. Keep it up, Chika!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('315181184', '315181', '2018/2019', '4', '', '', 'Chika is polite to adults and peers in and out of the class. She follows the instructions, stays focused during the lessons, and did well through her tasks. She has made good progress across the academic year. I wish she continues her study and will be better for the next level. It has been a pleasure having the oportunity to have Fifi in my class.', '2019-05-31', ''),
	('315184171', '315184', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alvaro is able to separate work and social times. He tries his best to complete his work on time, but he still needs to work more carefully to avoid careless mistakes. However, Alvaro has shown his best performance this term. Keep up the good work, Alvaro!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315184172', '315184', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alvaro makes friends easily. He is polite and kind to his peers and teachers. He has good ability to understand the lesson but he needs to concentrate more during the lesson and test at hand. Added effort and attention on his part could raise his grades. Keep your spirit up, alvaro!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315184173', '315184', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alvaro is continuing to grow independent on doing the school work. He has great enthusiasm for everything we do in class. However, He is having some difficulties in Science. Kindly continue to review this with Him nightly. Good luck, Alvaro!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315184174', '315184', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alvaro arrives at school each day with a smile and self- confident eventthough he frequently comes to class unprepared. He has difficulty memorizing scientific concepts. More review before test will help him to get a better result in Science subject. He is learning to be cooperative when working in groups. However, Alvaro has done a very nice job this term. Keep learning and improving Alavro in the next grade!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315185171', '315185', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Dearly is always ready to learn. She is achieving in all academic areas. Her pleasant personality and cooperative attitude are the assets of our class. Well done, Dearly!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315185172', '315185', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Dearly is an enjoyable student in class. She is polite to peers and adults in and out the classroom.She needs to be able to separate work and social times so that she can stay focused on the task at hand. Keep up the good work, Dearly!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315185173', '315185', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'We are glad that recently Dearly has started expressing her needs and her wants verbally. She starts to communicate more actively with her classmates and teachers. Dearly is building up herself confidence and able to perform in front of the class. She has an easy- going personality and it is effortless to be around her. Keep up the great work, Dearly!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315185174', '315185', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Dearly is able to transition easily from one activity to the next. She asks and answer questions that demonstrate understanding. She needs to stay focused on the task at hand and pays attention to detail in daily work. However, she listens and follows direction well during the lessons with a little help from the teachers. Show your best performance in the next grade, Dearly!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315186171', '315186', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Raina is polite and respectful to her peers and teachers. She can follow the rules well. She is also capable and eager to follow the class activity. She still needs to improve her English and school work on time. Keep learning and improving, Raina!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315186172', '315186', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Raina is a kind and calm girl in the class. She makes friends easily. She has difficulty applying the spelling of words. She needs to gain confidence in her ability to do the work in class. We believe if the help comes from home will deliver her many benefits. Keep your high spirit, Raina!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315186173', '315186', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Raina is pleasure to have around out the class activity. She needs to study harder. She sometimes loses her focus during the lesson. Reviewing the lesson after school and doing exercise from the book would be a good thing to improve her score. The teachers still need to encourage her to be more active and get involved in the classroom. Keep moving forward, Raina!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315186174', '315186', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Raina is a friendly and easy going girl in our class. She needs to increase academic skill, such as Math and Science. She needs to pay closer attention to those lessons. She has shown steady progress in Bahasa Indonesia skills subjects. Keep learning and growing mature nicely, Raina!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315187171', '315187', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Diego shows good performance on his daily work and assignment. He has good ability in English writing. He needs to improve his skill in reading comprehension. He can get better result if he does his work carefully when doing the test. Keep you best effort, Diego!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315187172', '315187', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Diego has made good improvement in his work. Added effort and attention on his part could raise his Math grades and strengthen his other academic subject. Keep your spirit up, Diego!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315187173', '315187', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Diego is growing to be an independent boy in the class. He still needs much practising in several subject. Doing more review at home will help him in memorizing his memory about the lesson. Good luck in the next term, Diego!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315187174', '315187', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Diego is gaining self- confidence during all class activities. He seeks clarification to the teachers for something he does not understand. He needs to slow down and check his work carefully in Math. Diego\'s speed and accuracy will improve greatly if he memorize his basic addition and subtraction facts. Go ahead to keep struggling in learning, Diego!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315188171', '315188', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fazli is an active boy. He is also an enthusiastic learner. He is achieving well in all academic skill areas. The teachers still encourage him to manage his feeling and emotions in class. Keep doing your best, Fazli!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315188172', '315188', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fazli has an expensive knowledge of higher thinking in Science. He seeks information independently. Sometimes, he enjoys dramatization to express his idea clearly. He could to be more cooperative when working groups. You can do better, Fazli !', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315188173', '315188', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has truly been a pleasure getting to know Fazli this year. He asks and answers questions to demonstrate understanding. What a great job, Fazli! He still needs to improve classroom attitude during all activities with his peers. We believe he will get more pleasant place if he can make a positive effort in this area.', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315188174', '315188', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Fazli takes pride in his work independently in all subjects. He needs to learn how to express his idea in a proper way,and he requires support and constant motivation to interact with classmates in a positive way. He also needs to follow teacher directions without complaining. Moreover, Fazli has put his best effort to perform his interest during the lesson. Stay positive and keep up the good work, Fazli!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315189171', '315189', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Gahisan is an easy going boy. He needs to improve his responsibility to finish his works given by the teacher. As he often does his works with less effort. The teachers still try to encourage him to be more focus on his lesson to achieve a better improvement. Good luck, Ghaisan!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315189172', '315189', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ghaisan is an enjoyable student. He needs to be encouraged to use English in class activities. He can communicate his understanding well. He also needs to concetrate more during lesson. It would be better for him to pay more attention to the details in his daily works. Keep learning and improving, Ghaisan!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315189173', '315189', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ghaisan is gaining self- confidence in outside class activity. He needs to develop a better sense of responsibility to finish his work especially in English basic skill. Reviewing the past lesson more at home will help him to get a better result. Keep learning and improving, Ghaisan!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315189174', '315189', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'He shows respect for teachers and peers. We appreciate his struggle achieve a better result. However, he requires constant encouragement to build his confidence and motivation within himself to learn and grow. Trust yourself that you can do better. Keep going when things get tough, Ghaisan!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315190171', '315190', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naufal is capable student. He needs to work more carefully to avoid careless mistakes. He could have performed better if he pays more attentions and does his work seriously. Do your best, Naufal!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
