	('315194171', '315194', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Robin is a nice boy and has good performance in his daily school. He always comes with a smile to class and is steady to learn. He has good handwriting and easy to read. He is capable of doing class works but rarely turns in homework. However, he still needs to manage his class time better. Keep improving and learning, Robin!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315194172', '315194', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Robin is a cheerful boy in our class. He has good ability to understand the lessons but he needs concentrate more during the lesson, through he needs to be encouraged to use English in class activities, he can communicate his understanding well. Keep improving, Robin!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315194173', '315194', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Robin is a nice boy. He always comes to the class with a smile and is steady to learn. During the lesson, he always asks question or seeks clarification when needed. We still encourage him to do his school work independently in science carefully. Please continue to review this with him nightly, good luck Robin in the next term!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315194174', '315194', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Robin is having problem in Science comprehension during test. He seems to show no interest while Science test, more review at home  would be very helpful to get his ability in Science subject. Trust yourself and be confidence you can achieve more in the grade, Robin!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315195171', '315195', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Shakina shows good work on her daily works and assignments. She is also a helpful girl to her classmates. She can follow the teacher instruction as fast as she can than others. That is good Shakina. She still needs to work carefully to avoid careless mistakes in doing some tasks. Keep up the good work, Shakina!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315195172', '315195', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Shakina is a good student. She respects the teachers and care about her peers. She has made good effort indoing her test. Eventhough, she hesitates during class assessments and waits for the teachers instruction. Do your best, Shakina! ', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315195173', '315195', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Shakina is a happy child, she smiles often and really laid back at everything does. She asks question or seeks clarifications when needed. We still encourage her to do her school works carefully. However, she has done her best effort in every single assignment. Keep improving and learning, shakina !', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315195174', '315195', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Shakina does well in the class, however she needs to improve her concrentation and motivated during Science test. She sometimes is easy to give up, we trust she can do it by herself even though the teachers always motivates her. Always believe in yourself, Shakina and stay positive. Keep it up!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315196171', '315196', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Steven has progressing in his socialization and academic. He needs to be more active to take a part in calss discussion. The teachers still encourage him to finish his school work on time. Keep improving yourself, Steven!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
