	('315196174', '315196', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Congratulation Steven for your best achievements in primary one, we are really proud of you! He is really gifted and talented in his interest of drawing beyond his imagination. He puts evident effort into his work as he completes assigments with quality in mind.', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315197171', '315197', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zahra has been conscientious about getting her work done and turned on time. She needs to work more carefully to avoid careless mistakes, Keep doing your best, Zahra!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315197172', '315197', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zahra is capable student in our class. She speaks English consistenly and she is the only one who can turn her daily activity into English. She manages her feelings and emotions well with her peers and teachers. She is also a fast learner but she hurries through  work and makes careless mistakes. Moreover, she has shown good progress this term. Keep up your good work, Zahra!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('315197173', '315197', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Zahra is a nice student. She is excited in learning something new. She tries to do her best for her school work. She still needs to learn the vacabularies of social studies  to relate her answers problem solving clearly in test. However, she is a good  participant in native class. God job Zahra.                                                                                                      ', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('315197174', '315197', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'It has been pleasure to have Zahra in our class this year. She is comitted to doing her best. We appreciate that she is confident to express her thought verbally. She still needs improvement in social studies vocabulary words. We believe yet review at home would be very helpful for her to maintain or gain her ability on that lesson. Keep doing your best, Zahra!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('315198171', '315198', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Shidiq is a smart boy. He has good ability to understand the lesson. He always listens to the teacher s instruction and follows the rules. The teacher still encourages his confidence to express what he feels in class.  Good luck, Shidiq.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('315198172', '315198', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Shidiq is a calm boy. He is polite to the teachers. He shows good performance in the class. The teacher still encourages him to be more active in the class especially in speaking English for daily activity. Keep learning and improving Shidiq !', '2017-12-19', NULL),
