	('315198174', '315198', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Shidiq has made progress in almost all academic areas.\nHe is capable of much butter work this term. He is maturing nicely and we hope this continues in the next grade. Keep doing your best, Shidiq!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
