	('316004161', '316004', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arya arrives at school each day with a smile and ready to learn. He is able to separate work and social times. He could solve his school workÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s problem after seeking the clarification detail from the teachers. He tries to understand well. \r\nKeep learning and improving, Arya!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316004162', '316004', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arya is a quite active learner in the class. He asks question or seeks clarification when needed. He shows good performance in Math lesson. He does the exercise with details. Good job, Arya!', '2016-12-16', '2'),
	('316004164', '316004', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arya seems eager to improve in several subjects. He has made nice progress this reporting period. HeÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s capable of much better work this term. What a wonderful work, Arya!', '2017-06-15', '5'),
	('316004171', '316004', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arya is a clever, easy to socialize, and polite student. Sometimes, he likes to daydream in some class activities. But, overall Arya gets  good scores and he has a good attitude to his teachers and friends. Keep it up, Arya!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316004172', '316004', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arya is a good and active student. He needs to pay more attention while the teachers are explaining. He has to do all homeworks timely and more review all the lessons at home. Keep doing better, Arya!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('316004173', '316004', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arya is a kind student. He is clever also and easy to accept the lessons. He should be more careful when playing with his friends and can control his emotions. He should always be reminded to bring complete books in each lesson and  doing classroom exercises. Hopefully he could show better progress next term. Be better, Arya!', '2018-03-23', NULL),
	('316004174', '316004', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arya is a kind student. He is successful to finish all the lessons in this 2nd grade well. Hopefully in the next grade, Arya can improve his achievement. Good luck, Arya!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316005161', '316005', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Ataya is a cheerful boy. He seems happily in every single activity in the class. He makes friends easily with his peers, his social skill grows independently since the beginning of school year. The teachers still encourage him to be more active in English, Science and Math lessons. He needs review more and more at home, we believe the help from home will help him to do those assessments independently and get  good result.\r\nGood luck, Ataya!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316006161', '316006', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Banu is a moody boy in the class. Sometimes, he has a good passion to work hard in several subjects such asMath and Citizenship. If he keeps focusing on those lessons he can get a better result.\r\nKeep learning, Banu!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316006162', '316006', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Banu is trying hard and continues to make steady progress in Math and Science. He needs to write carefully for him sometimes does mistake when doing the tasks. Keep trying and learning in the next semester, Banu!', '2016-12-16', '11'),
	('316006164', '316006', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B-', 'Banu needs to improve his focuse when the teacher is explaining as he often misses the concept of lessons when the teacher is not around. He is still quite dependent on teachers to help him on finishing his work. We always try our best to help him in many ways we can. Kep on going, Banu!', '2017-06-15', '11'),
	('316006171', '316006', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Banu is an active student in every single class activity. He needs to develop more positives ways to interact with others. The teachers still need to encourage him to achieve better achievements especially in Bahasa Indonesia and PKN. Keep trying and shows your best, Banu!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316006172', '316006', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Banu is an active student. He has to be more carefully when he is playing with his friends. He has to do all the homeworks timely and pay more attention during lesson hours while the teachers are explaining. Keep doing your best, Banu!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('316006173', '316006', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Banu is a kind student. He must be punctual in working on classroom exercises and assignments.  He should always be reminded to bring complete books based on the timetable. Keep trying to be better, Banu!', '2018-03-23', NULL),
	('316006174', '316006', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Banu is a kind student. He increases his ability in most of the lessons well. While Banu has been performing well overall, he still needs more effort and practice at home to improve his abilities. He needs stay focus during the class and concentrate harder on his work habits. Keep doing your best, Banu!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316007161', '316007', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Denis is a shy boy, he answers only when the teachers asked. He can follow the class rules in and out the classroom well during school hours. Denis still needs improvement in English and Science, he needs more review at home. We believe the help comes from home will make Denis confident to do both lessons independently in the next term. \r\nWish you luck, Denis!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316008161', '316008', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Feyza always comes with a smile to the class and ready to learn. She is a respectful girl to the teachers and friends in and out of the classroom. She can manage her feelings and emotions well in the class. \r\nKeep the wonderful things you are doing, Feyza!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316008162', '316008', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Feyza is a polite, kind and well- mannered girl in the class. She is capable of doing classroom work independently. She has an eager to learn all subjects. Well done, Feyza!', '2016-12-16', '6'),
	('316008164', '316008', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Feyza works well in all basic subject. By the end of the term, she performs well and has become very responsible and reliable. She is able to work independently, follow directions accurately and promptly she always manages to get her work done in a timely and effective manner. Keep up the good work, Feyza in the next grade!', '2017-06-15', '4'),
	('316008171', '316008', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Feyza is a clever student and she is fast learner. She can join with her friends and sometimes her mood up and down. But, overall she can follow all lessons well. Keep up, Fey!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316008172', '316008', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Feyza is a moody student. She lacks of confidence to express her feeling and likes to be alone in the class. However, she is a clever and diligent.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('316008173', '316008', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Feyza is a quite and obedient student. She is clever and accept the lessons easily.  Her mood is better than the previous term. She has a good handwriting. Keep it up, Feyza!', '2018-03-23', NULL),
	('316008174', '316008', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Feyza is a quite as a result obedient student. She is clever and able to accept the lessons easily, she can finish all the lessons in 2nd grade well.  Congratulation and keep shining, Feyza!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316009161', '316009', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Jeflow is a nice boy. It has truly been a pleasure getting to know him this year. He is able to separate work and social times. He asks and answers questions to demonstrate understanding. \r\nWhat a great job, Jeflow!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316009162', '316009', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Jeflow has qualities of leadership. Jeflow still needs to manage his feeling when he plays in group. However, Jeflow is an enthusiastic learner in the class. He always asks the clarification when needed. Good job, Jeflow!', '2016-12-16', '5'),
	('316009164', '316009', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Jeflow is a pleasant and conscientious student in our class. Sometimes, he makes little effort when he is under direct supervision. He is easy to get distracted that makes his work late in class. Jeflow also needs to improve classroom attitude during all activities with his peers. We believe he will get more pleasant place if he can make a positive effort in this areas. Keep improving Jeflow in the next grade!', '2017-06-15', '3'),
	('316009171', '316009', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Jeflow is a clever and very active student. He needs to control his emotion, as he often loses his control when he interact with others. He studies well and gets good scores. Be nice and keep moving on, Jeflow!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316009172', '316009', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Jeflow is an active student. He is smart and has good understanding in all lessons. He has to control his self during play time. Keep trying to be better, Jeflow!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('316009173', '316009', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Jeflow is a clever and very active student. He can control his emotions now. His score decreases in this term. Be better for the next term, Jeflow!', '2018-03-23', NULL),
	('316009174', '316009', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Finally Jeflow can finish all the lessons in 2nd grade well. He can manage his emotion better. Congratulation and always be humble, Jeflow!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316010161', '316010', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Bian is a kind and calm student, she respects the teachers and friends at school. That is good, Bian! She needs to increase herself confidence to speak up in English. If she comes to school regulary, it will help her to improve her scores. \r\nWish you luck in the next term, Bian!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316011161', '316011', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Najat still likes to daydream in the class. She needs to focus on the task at hand. Taking more responsibility and stay focus are the keys to have a better score. \r\nKeep studying and be better in the next term, Najat!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316011162', '316011', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Najat is capable of doing classroom work but rarely turns in assignments on time. She needs constant encouragement in every subject. She needs to pay more attention to detail in classwork. Keep learning hard and focusing on your work, Najat!', '2016-12-16', '16'),
	('316011164', '316011', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B-', 'Najat is cheerful, she smiles often and is really laid back everything does. She has an easy- going personality and it is effortless to be around her. It is important that she learns to be attentive while listening to others. She faces difficulty in participating during lessons and class discussion. She needs teacher guidance to finish her work. It is important that she learns to be good listener and focus more on paying attention. Keep your focus up and study hard in the next grade, Najat! ', '2017-06-15', '17'),
	('316011171', '316011', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Najat is a cheerful student. She likes to tell a story in front the class or with her teachers and friends. Najat needs to improve her style of studying. Keep trying to be better, Najat!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316011172', '316011', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Najat is an active student. She has to be a good listener. She needs to pay attention during lesson hours. She has to do all the homeworks in time. She needs to be reminded to bring all subject books accurately. Try to be better, Najat!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('316011173', '316011', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Najat is a sweet and an active student. She is sociable welcoming to her friends. Listening to the teachers advices and showing and good behaviour are a must. She has to practice and review all the lessons at home. Hopefully a cooperation between teacher her parent would give significant effect for the next term. Keep improving, Najat!', '2018-03-23', NULL),
	('316011174', '316011', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Najat can finish all the lessons in this grade better than the previous semester. Hopefully, Najat can be more dicipline and focus to her study. Congratulation and keep trying to be better, Najat!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316012161', '316012', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Darlene is a kind, caring and friendly character that makes her a role model in our class. She adapts easily to new situations. However, Darlene needs to pay closer attention to finish her school work on time. We can hardly wait to see how you impress us during next term,\r\nKeep it up Darlene!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316012162', '316012', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Darlene has a good self concept in every single activity in the class. She has an eager to learn in all subjects. She puts evident effort into her work as she completes assignments with quality in mind. That is good Darlene. Go ahead to show your great performance in the next semester, keep up the wonderful things you are doing, Darlene! ', '2016-12-16', '4'),
	('316012164', '316012', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'We are glad that Darlene has started expressing her needs more verbally. Darlene is building up herself confidence and is now able to perform in front of the class. Keep doing good work, Darlene!', '2017-06-15', '6'),
	('316012171', '316012', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Darlene is a critical and active student in the class, she is cheerful and she can cooperate with her friends.  She studies well and she is very enthusiastic, especially in Mathematic and science subjects. Keep improving, Darlene!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316012172', '316012', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Darlene is a smart and full control student. She can interact easily. Keep up the good work, Darlene!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('316012173', '316012', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Darlene is a quiet girl. She is improving and making significant progress to herself. She is smart, calm and sociable. Showing your best, Darlene!', '2018-03-23', NULL),
	('316012174', '316012', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Darlene is a cheerful girl. She is improving and making significant progress to herself. Hopefully in the next grade, Darlene can be more active especially in speaking skill.  Keep humble and good luck, Darlene!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316013161', '316013', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Naurah is a helpful student to her partner; sheÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s willing to help a classmate who sits next to her.  She gets along well with others nicely in the classroom. We still encourage her to make her confident in her daily school work consistently. Overall, Naurah has done a very nice job this term.\r\nKeep it up, Naurah!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316013162', '316013', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naurah gets along well with others in the classroom. She works independently and stays on her tasks. That is one area improvement in this semester. Keep learning hard and being confident next semester, Naurah!', '2016-12-16', '7'),
	('316013164', '316013', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'We are glad that recently Naurah has started expressing her needs and wants more verbally. She starts to communicate more with her classmates and teachers expressively. Naurah has difficult time focusing her attention on ScienceÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s lesson. However, we truly believe that if she were to simply apply herself, she would do a good job. She is a very capable individual. Keep up the good work, Naurah!', '2017-06-15', '8'),
	('316013171', '316013', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naurah has shown well-achievement in his learning process at school. She is able to follow the lesson well and also express her ideas in class. But sometimes she still likes to daydream. she needs to pay more attention and to be more active in learning activities. Reviewing and remembering what had been taught is needed for her to improve her academic performance. Study harder, Naurah!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316013172', '316013', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Naurah shows enthusiasm for learning activities. She has made some progresses in her study. Now She likes to ask the teachers or share her ideas in class discussions.  She just needs to be more confident and study harder.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('316013173', '316013', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naurah is a clever, easy to socialize, and polite student. Sometimes, she likes to daydream in some class activities. But, overall Naurah gets  good scores and she has a good attitude to her teachers and friends. Keep it up, Naurah!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('316013174', '316013', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Finally Naurah has finished her study in the 2nd grade well. Naurah shows enthusiasm for learning activities. Hopefully in the next grade, Naurah can be more confident and active in the learning activities.', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316014161', '316014', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Malik is an enthusiastic learner. He always completes daily assignments in a timely manner. He pays attention to detail in daily work. He should be more carefully in his written, sometimes He writes in a rush and misses the letters in every subject. We are so proud of all you have accomplished. \r\nKeep up the wonderful things you are doing!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316014162', '316014', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Malik has good responsibility on his tasks. He is trying hard and continues to make steady progress in his handwriting skill to avoid careless mistake when he answers the questions. However, Malik shows respects to all the teachers and he can get along with his classmates and different level. Keep doing your best, Malik!', '2016-12-16', '3'),
	('316014164', '316014', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'For MalikÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s age, his ability to express himself verbally is impressive. He speaks well and seems confident in his use of the language. He is able to articulate his needs in a clear and concise manner and also responds well to those around him. Congratulations Malik for your best achievement, Malik! ', '2017-06-15', '2'),
	('316014171', '316014', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Malik shows enthusiasm for classroom activities. He is a good learner. He is an active participant in small or large group discussions. He likes to share his ideas frequently in the learning activities. Moreover, He very enjoys spending time with friends and likes to chat with them while studying. So he needs to pay more attention in learning activities. I am so proud of all he has accomplished.', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316014172', '316014', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Malik shows enthusiasm for classroom activities. He is a good learner. He likes to share his ideas and questions to the teachers frequently in the learning activities. Moreover, he is very friendly. He never discriminates his friends.', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('316014173', '316014', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Malik is a critical and active student in the class. He is cheerful and can cooperate with his friends.  He studies well and is very enthusiastic, especially in Mathematic and science subjects. Keep improving, Malik!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('316014174', '316014', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Finally Malik has finished his study in the 2nd grade well. Malik is a good learner. He shows enthusiasm for classroom activities. Hopefully in the next grade, Malik can improve his achievements better and keep spirit.', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316015161', '316015', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Queensha is a quite active learner in the class. She asks questions or seeks clarifications when needed. We still encourage queensha to do her school works carefully. However, she has done her best effort in every single assignment. \r\nKeep improving and learning, Queensha!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316015162', '316015', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Queensha has good confidence to perform. She works slowly and and needs to improve her skills in managing time more effectively. She needs to pay more attention during teacherÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢s explanation. If she keep focusing on learning she will get a better result. You can do better next semester, Queensha!', '2016-12-16', '9'),
	('316015164', '316015', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B-', 'Queensha is able to follow the lesson well. She tries her best to participate in class discussion and when she speaks, she does o with confidence. She enjoys school work that was assigned for her. Although she still needs a lot of practice in her comprehending of Science. We believe through practice and review more at home she will able to achieve good result. Keep your trying, Queensha!', '2017-06-15', '9'),
	('316015171', '316015', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Queensha has good ability to understand the lesson but she needs to concentrate more during the lesson. She is also lack of confident with herself. So being confident and focusing more her attention in learning activities in class will give her a better progress in her study. Study harder, Queensha!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316015172', '316015', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Queensha always puts evident effort into her work as she completes assignments. She has done a very nice job this term. However, she is a shy and quiet person in the classroom. She needs to be more active and convident to share her ideas or confusions to the teachers.  Keep up your achievements, Queensha!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('316015173', '316015', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Queensha is good and like to socialize with her friends. She also likes to help them. She easily understands her lessons, but sometimes she loses her  focus in learning and still chatting with her close friends. Hopefully in the next grade, Queensha can focus more on learning and reduce her chat while the teacher is explaining.', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('316015174', '316015', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Finally Queensha has finished her study in the 2nd grade well. Queensha has done a very nice job this term. However, she is a shy and quiet person in the classroom. Hopefully in the next grade, Queensha needs to be more active and confident to share her ideas or confusions to the teachers.', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316016161', '316016', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Radi is a cute boy in our class, he always talks politely with teachers and peers. He has a strength memorizing about something new in the class. His speaking skill has good fluency in English. He still needs improvement to do his school work independently and consistently to finish on time. \r\nBe better in the next term, Radi!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316016162', '316016', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'C', 'Radi shows great progress in finishing his tasks this semester. He has an eager to improve all lessons during study activities in the class. He still needs to manage his feelings in the class. Keep improving, Radi!', '2016-12-16', '14'),
	('316016164', '316016', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B-', ' We are glad that recently Radi has started expressing his needs and wants more verbally. He starts to communicate more with his classmates and teachers expressively. He can work independently on the tasks directed by his teacher. He follows classroom rules very well and does everything in good manners. In the prepatory, we would encourage him to interact more with others in primary 2 especially in class discussion. Welldone, Radi!', '2017-06-15', '13'),
	('316016171', '316016', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Radi is a cheerful student, he shows his hospitality and cares with others. He can follow all lessons well. Keep moving on, Radi!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316016172', '316016', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Radi is a kind and polite boy. He is showing his improvement in all subjects. He speaks very well in the class. He needs to be more focus and do all the studies rapidly. Keep moving on, Radi!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('316016173', '316016', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Radi is a quite and obedient student. He often day dreams during the lessons. He does not do practices and assignments in  time. However he is able to maintain his performance in this term. Being more responsible to the homework is a must. Try to be better, Radi!', '2018-03-23', NULL),
	('316016174', '316016', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Finnaly Radi can finish all the lessons in this grade well. Hopefully, Radi can pay more attention to his concentration in every single activity. Congratulation and keep being kind, Radi!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316017161', '316017', '2016/2017', '1', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Rashiqa has made great progress across the curriculum since the beginning of the school year. She puts evident effort into her work as she completes assignments with quality in mind. Rashiqa  still needs time to cheer her smile up when she comes to the class. \r\nKeep being cheerful, Rashiqa!', '2016-10-14', NULL),
	('316017162', '316017', '2016/2017', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Rashiqa has qualities of leadership nto her peers She shows great progress on her independence, that is good Rashiqa. She can absorb the concept of Math easily. So, that she is capable to help her friends to accomplish work in group. It has truly been a pleasure getting to know her this year. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing, Rashiqa!', '2016-12-16', '1'),
	('316017164', '316017', '2016/2017', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B+', 'Rashiqa is a joy to be guided. She is always on time in every task given and she is very eager to learn. She takes a keen interest in all her works, most agreeable and also a very willing student. However, she has tendency to overchat with her peers at the end of this term. She needs to recognize the value of undivided attention. Otherwise, She is maturing herself nicely this year and we hope this continues until next grade. What a wonderful work, Rashiqa!', '2017-06-15', '1'),
	('316017171', '316017', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Rashiqa is a clever and active student in the class. She studies well and achieves good marks in most of the lessons. She also shows good conduct in class. Good job, Rashiqa!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('316017172', '316017', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rashiqa is a nice and clever student. She understands the one-to-one concept of the lessons. She has shown her best. Keep it up, Rashiqa!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
