	('316056173', '316056', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Darryl is always ready to learn. He is showing achievement  in all academic skill. He always makes an effort to learn. However he still needs to do the task carefully. Keep up your good work, Darryl !', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('316056174', '316056', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Darryl has done very nice job in this year, taking pride in his work and completing assignments with quality in mind. He seems happy in every single activity in the class. We still encourage him to be more confident in speaking English.  Keep up the great work, Darryl! ', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('316058181', '316058', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Cinta has a wonderful skill of Art. She produces many good pictures and crafts. Unfortunately, she is frequently busy with drawing during the lessons. It prevents her from understanding the lessons. However, she requires ongoing support to develop an understanding of note taking from teachers and readings in preparation for tests.', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('317001171', '317001', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alaric is a nice boy in our class. He is capable to follow the class activity and the lessons well. He has a good handwriting and enjoys spending his time with his friends. He needs to work more slowly and accurately to avoid his careless mistakes. The teachers still encourage him to exhibit the use of English in class activities, so he can communicate his understanding well. Keep your high spirit, Alaric!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317001172', '317001', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alaric shows his progress in this term between daily and test. Those are always done by himself. He always comes with a smile and is ready to learn. Congratulations Alaric for your best achievement this term. Keep up your good work, Alaric!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317001173', '317001', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Alaric has made progress in almost all academic areas. He is capable of much better work this term. He is maturing nicely and we hope this continues in the next term. Keep up the good work, Alaric!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317001174', '317001', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'We are glad Alaric is eager to participate in class discussions. He is becoming more independent when completing class assigments in a timely manner and working with quality in mind. He demonstrates hard work and produces quality results.Congratulation for your best achievement in this term, Alaric. You are an amazing student and truly shines! ', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('317002171', '317002', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Devin is an obedient student in our class. He always listens to the teacher instruction. He needs to strengthen his skill in Science and English. A consonant guidance to review his lesson at home will give him many benefits. The teacher still encourage him to exhibit the use of English in class activities, he can communicate his understanding well. Keep your high spirit, Devein!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317002172', '317002', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Devin is a friendly boy. He can adapt to new situations. He demonstrates a need for direct supervision to complete work. He still needs to be a  self- motivated in doing Science. We believe the more review at home will help him to get a good result in Science. Moreover, he has shown his good progress to be an independent boy at class. Keep learning, Devin!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317002173', '317002', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Devin is growing to be an independent boy in the class to finish all school works by himself. We are very proud to see his consistence in daily school work. We hope this effort will continue in the next term. Keep up the good work, Devin!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317002174', '317002', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Devin is growing mature nicely this term and becoming a good listener to his peers. He needs to be encouraged to work more slowly and accurately to avoid careless mistakes in every test. He also needs to learn more Science vocabulary to perform well on Science tests.  Never give up and always keep learning on what you have done, Devin!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('317003171', '317003', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arfa is a smart student in our class. He has good handwriting. He shows interest in Science and reading books. He enjoys spending time with friends. However, he needs to manage his feeling and emotions well in class. Keep it up, Arfa!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317003172', '317003', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arfa has done a very nice job this term. He pays attention to the detail in his daily works and stays focused on the teachers explanation. He is mastering English grammar easily. Keep up the great work, Arfa!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317003173', '317003', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arfa is an enthusiastic learner and enjoy spending time with his peers. He shows perseverance in all he does and often completes his work early than others. He must be careful in doing his work to reduce his mistakes. WeÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢re hoping this effort will continue next term. Great job, Arfa!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317003174', '317003', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Arfa is a curious and kindhearted boy in our class. He tackles new challenges eagerly with positive attitude. He oftens forgets capital letters and punctuation while put it into sentence that one area that must be improvement. He is a leader during in class Science activity, he also has strengthen in that lesson that makes his easy to lead his friends. He has an impressive understanding and depth knowledge about his interests. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing, Arfa!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('317004171', '317004', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Karenina shows good progress this term. She has good ability in Math and she can follow the rules in the class. She is kind of moody girl sometimes. However, she needs to be more careful in doing her daily works and assignments. Keep doing your bet, Karenina!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317004172', '317004', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Karenina is a cheerful and active girl. She has good confidence to speak up and present her work. She still needs to stay focused on the task at hand especially in Math and return homeworks on time. However, she has shown her best result in this term. Keep up the wonderful things that you are doing, Karen! ', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317004173', '317004', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Karenina is capable student in doing her tests and school work by herself well especially in English basic skill. She still needs to improve her Bahasa skills such as citizenship and social studies to relate the words on her answer in tests. Doing more review at home and using class time constructively will give her a better effort in the next term. Keep learning, Karenina!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317004174', '317004', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Karen is capable of producing better work, however she needs more focusing on homework at hand to return it on the right time. She has no hesitate to admit to the teacher when she has problems during the lessons. We do really hope could have more practice to increase her skills and prepare for the next grade level. Keep doing your best, Karen!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('317005171', '317005', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kaia is a cheerful girl. She always comes with a smile to the class and ready to learn. She also has willing to help her classmates.  She still needs to improve her writing skill. Keep doing your best, Kaia !', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317005172', '317005', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kaia is an easy going girl. She is always willing to help her classmate. She enjoys spending time with friends. She completes her work with quality in mind. However she still needs to use class time constructively and come to school on time. Keep doing your best Kaia !', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317005173', '317005', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Kaia is a smart girl. She is an active participant in Science lesson. She has good improvement on her writing. However, she still needs to be more responsible with her book and assignments. Keep doing your best, Kaia!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317005174', '317005', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kaia is a cheerful girl. She seems happy in every single activity in the class. She is able to separate work and social times. The teacher still encourage her to tell the truth during class activity in and out with her peers and teacher. Be better in the next grade, Kaia!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('317006171', '317006', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naya is a calm girl. She only answers when the teacher asks. She often does her works with less effort. She needs to improve her confident to work independently. She also need to review the lesson at home. A constant guidance for her lessons will help her to do the work independently. Keep learning and improving, Naya!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317006172', '317006', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Khanaya shows good progress in her daily tasks. She is nice to her teacher and friends. The teachers still encourage her to be more active in the class especially in speaking for daily activity. Keep learning and improving, Khanaya !', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317006173', '317006', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Naya has been progressing in her social skills. She enjoys spending time with her friends. She is able to separate work and social times.Added effort and attention on her Science could raise her scores. Keep your spirit, Naya !', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317006174', '317006', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Naya has progressing in her socialization. She enjoys spending time with her friends. Sometimes she does her work with less effort. She still needs to  be more self motivated  in doing Science. Doing more review at home will help her to achieve better result in next grade. Keep learning and improviing Naya!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('317007171', '317007', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Octa is a nice student. She has good hand writing. The teachers still encourage her to be more active in Engllish, Science and Math lessons. She needs to practice more for her lessons at home, Having more review at home will give her many benefits. Good luck, Octa !', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317007172', '317007', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Octa is an obedient student. She enjoy spending time with her friends. She needs to improve her responsibility to finish her works given by the teachers as she often does her work with less effort. You can do better, Octa !', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317007173', '317007', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Octa is a good student. She is able to follow the lessons in class. She sometimes likes to daydream in the class. She needs to stay focus and pay more attention on the lesson will deliver to get a better result. Keep practicing and trying, Octa !', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317007174', '317007', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Octa is a nice student. She is able to follow the lesson in the class. She completes her daily assignment in a timely manner.  She still needs to improve her English vocabulary as she often misses the concept of Science, for she does not understand the meaning of the words. Keep learning and improving, Octa!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('317008171', '317008', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Habie has good creativity in making art work. He enjoys spending time with his friends. He needs to strengthen his skill in English and Science lessons. A constant guidance to review his lessons at home will deliver him many benefits. Keep learning and improving, Habie !', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317009171', '317009', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Samara is a good and calm student. She has good interest in following the lesson. She enjoys spending time with her friends. She understands the concept of simple addition and subtraction. However, she still needs to manage her feeling during class activities. Keep up the good work, Samara!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317009172', '317009', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Samara is an independent learner. She comprehends quickly and puts evident effort into her work as she completes assigments with quality in mind. Moreover, she is able to separate work and social times. You are wonderful, Samara!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317009173', '317009', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Samara always comes with a smile to the class and ready to learn. She is an active learner during activities in and out the class. She tries to understand well about what she is worrying then she continues to her work independently. What a great job. Samara !', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317009174', '317009', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Samara is working well with other fellows and in all study areas. She stays focused during the lesson and work fast than others. She seems enjoys at school even though she does not come at the beginning academic year, she adapts easily to her teachers and peers. She is smart, motivated and hard- working. Keep shining and showing your best, Samara!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('317010171', '317010', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin ', 'B', 'Diarra is a clever student and fast learner. She is socializing to her new friends well. Her performance to achieve the goals of most the lessons are prideable. Keep shining, Diarra!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317010172', '317010', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Diarra is a nice girl, she is shy about speaking in front the class. She has qualities of her works and has a good self-concept. Keep it up, Diarra!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317010173', '317010', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Diarra is a quite and obedient student, She is a  fast learner. Sometimes is lack of confident. She should be more brave to  speak in front the class.  She obeys the teachers and follow the clss rules. The teachers still need to encourage her to be more confident and be flexible when she gets involved in the class activities. Try to be better, Diarra!', '2018-03-23', NULL),
	('317010174', '317010', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Diarra, we have enjoyed having Diarra in our class this year.She has a lovely personality and works independently. She consistently puts her best effort on her works. Being more active to express what she feels and what she thinks to others will deliver her many benefits. Congratulation and good luck, Diarra!', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('317011171', '317011', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kenzie is developing positive ways to interact with others. He seems enjoy reading a lot. However, he needs to put more effort into his work so that he can complete assignments with quality in mind. \r\nKeep trying your best, Kenzie!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317011172', '317011', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kenzie shows respect for teachers and peers. He stays on his task with little supervision. He reads extensively for enjoyment. However, he needs to put his best effort on accomplishing his projects. Keep up your good work, Kenzie!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317011173', '317011', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Kenzie shows great progress on his social skills. He gets along well with others in the classroom. He seems to enjoy spending time with his classmates. However, he still needs to be more responsible to accomplish the tasks and projects. Keep up your good work, Kenzie!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317011174', '317011', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'We are so proud of Kenzie. He has worked hard for his first year in tis school. He has made a great job overall. He is capable of achieving a higher grade but needs to be more focused and responsible with his homeworks. Keep up the wonderful things you are doing, Kenzie!\r\n', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('317011181', '317011', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Kenzie is a nice student. He is now really excited helping his friend. He just needs to be more focus while studying. He also needs to pay attention to detail on his assignments. You can do more than you think, Kenzie!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('317011183', '317011', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Kenzie is polite to his teacher and peers. Sometimes, he still like to day dream in the class. He needs to be focus on the task. A constant review and paying more attention on the lesson will deliver him to be a better result, keep praktificing and trying, Kenzie!', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('317013171', '317013', '2017/2018', '1', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rain has shown well-achievement in his learning process at school. He is able to follow the lesson well and also express his ideas in class. But sometimes he still likes to daydream. He needs to pay more attention and to be more active in learning activities. Reviewing and remembering what had been taught is needed for him to improve his academic performance. Study harder, Rain!', '2017-10-13', NULL),
	('317013172', '317013', '2017/2018', '2', 'Mandarin', 'A', 'Rain has good ability to understand the lesson but he needs to concentrate more during the lesson. So focusing more his attention in learning activities in class will give him a better progress in his study. Study harder, Rain!', '2017-12-19', NULL),
	('317013173', '317013', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Rain is a clever and fast learner. He can understand the lesson well. He is also good to socialize with his friends, but sometimes his mood is up and down. He is still difficult to control his emotions. Hopefully next term, Rain can be more patient and better in controlling his emotions.', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317013174', '317013', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Finally Rain has finished his study in the 2nd grade well. Rain has good ability to understand the lesson but he needs to concentrate more during the lesson. Hopefully in the next grade, Rain can focus more his attention in learning activities and show a better progress in his study.', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('317017173', '317017', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', ' It is a pleasure to have Thalita in our class. She is able to grasp the materials well, especially the lessons that are delivered in Bahasa Indonesia. She is a diligent student, but sometimes she needs to be more careful in reading the instructions and the questions given. She also needs to improve her self-confidence to speak her mind in English. Keep up the good work, Thalita!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317017174', '317017', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Up to the end of this second semester, Thalita continues to make nice progress. She is eager to achieve her goals and willing to complete all assignments we give at school. She can improve her accuracy by remembering to review her work in order to get the best results. Keep up the good work, Thalita!', '2018-06-08', ''),
	('317017181', '317017', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Thalita demonstrates hard work and produces quality results. She stays focused on the task at hand. She shows respect to the teachers and gets along well with others in the classroom. However, more practice will bring benefits to her. Always do your best, Thalita!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('317017183', '317017', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Thalita shows respect for teachers and peers. She conducts herself with maturity to deal with matters. She has shown another talent in sport confidently. Keep doing your best, Thalita!\r\n\r\n12. Thalita shows respect for teachers and peers. She conducts herself with maturity to deal with matters. She has shown another talent in sport confidently. Keep doing your best, Thalita!\r\n\r\n12. Thalita shows respect for teachers and peers. She conducts herself with maturity to deal with matters. She has shown another talent in sport confidently. Keep doing your best, Thalita!\r\n\r\n', '2019-03-22', ''),
	('317018173', '317018', '2017/2018', '3', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Melati is an easy-going student. She can adapt quickly with her new environment.  She is very kind with her friends. She also shows enthusiasm in learning activities.She just needs to be more focused in her lessons. Study harder, Melati!', '2018-03-23', ''),
	('317018174', '317018', '2017/2018', '4', 'Mandarin', 'B', 'Finally Melati has finished her study in the 2nd grade well. Melati can adapt quickly and act very kind with her friends. She also shows enthusiasm in learning activities. Hopefully in the next grade, Melati can study harder and be more focused in her lessons.', '2018-06-08', NULL),
	('717071181', '717071', '2018/2019', '1', '', '', 'Fayyaz is still adapting to his new environment. He seems confused about the lessons and language usage. Actually, he has a good basic knowledge. However, he needs a constant encouragement in all areas. Keep up your spirit, Fayyaz and donÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢t be shy!', '2018-10-12', ''),
	('717071183', '717071', '2018/2019', '3', '', '', 'Fayyaz seems eager to improve. He shows enthusiasm and willingness to learn. He has shown good progress this term. However, he still needs to improve his English skill. Keep up your spirit and do better, Fayyaz!', '2019-03-22', '');

